an class="min-w-0 flex-1">Fin for Sales</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="group-data-open:before:content-[&#x27;-&#x27;] shrink-0 before:content-[&#x27;+&#x27;]"></span></span></button></h3><div class="text-current/70 space-y-2 px-5 pb-5"><p class="text-body font-sans! font-normal! mt-2">Handles inbound sales end-to-end</p></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="border-linen data-open:bg-off-white data-open:opacity-100 border border-b-0 opacity-60 last:border-b"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="group"><button type="button" data-value="0" data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" tabindex="0" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_ek96lubr9fk6ivbH2_" class="focus-visible:z-1 group relative items-baseline justify-between text-left focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-800 flex w-full flex-col px-5 pt-5"><span class="text-heading-5 mb-6 flex w-full items-start gap-3"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1">Fin for Ecommerce</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="group-data-open:before:content-[&#x27;-&#x27;] shrink-0 before:content-[&#x27;+&#x27;]"></span></span></button></h3><div class="text-current/70 space-y-2 px-5 pb-5"><p class="text-body font-sans! font-normal! mt-2">Handles the entire shopping journey</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="weekly-releases" class="relative grid scroll-mt-[130px] grid-cols-12 overflow-hidden py-10 lg:py-16" data-chapter-name="Weekly releases" data-chapter-analytics-id="btn_home_chapter_weekly_releases" data-analytics-region="weekly-releases" data-analytics-id="sec_home_weekly_releases"><div class="md:px-0! container col-span-full md:col-span-10 md:col-start-2"><div class="relative grid grid-cols-10 gap-x-4 gap-y-6 lg:gap-y-10"><div class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid gap-y-6 lg:items-start lg:gap-y-10"><div class="col-span-full flex flex-col gap-y-6 lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-1 lg:gap-y-10"><div class="text-body-lg font-serif"><p class="text-callout home-v2-reason-title relative mb-4 mr-5 text-pretty font-sans"><span class="mr-5 xl:absolute xl:right-full xl:top-0 xl:mr-10 2xl:mr-16"><span class="inline-flex overflow-hidden"><span class="inline-block" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(1em);transition:opacity 800ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1), transform 1000ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1);transition-delay:0ms">0</span><span class="inline-block" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(1em);transition:opacity 800ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1), transform 1000ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1);transition-delay:80ms">5</span></span></span>Fin gets better every week</p><p class="home-v2-reason-body text-current/80 text-pretty"><span class="block">We improve Fin at a rapid pace. In 2025, we shipped 226 <a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="/updates">product updates</a>.</span><span class="mt-4 block">As of June 2026, we have already shipped 191 this year. We are on track to 3x our productivity, thanks to our deep investment in <a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="https://ideas.fin.ai/p/2x-nine-months-later">AI engineering</a>.<!-- --> </span></p></div></div><div class="col-span-full lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-6"><div class="bg-fin/15 relative aspect-video"><div></div><div aria-hidden="true" data-dot-decorators="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 m-3 xl:m-4 m-0! z-20 text-white/60 *:size-2"><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current top-0 left-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current top-0 right-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current bottom-0 left-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current bottom-0 right-0"></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="complex-queries" class="relative grid scroll-mt-[130px] grid-cols-12 overflow-hidden py-10 lg:py-16" data-chapter-name="Complex queries" data-chapter-analytics-id="btn_home_chapter_complex_queries" data-analytics-region="complex-queries" data-analytics-id="sec_home_complex_queries"><div class="md:px-0! container col-span-full md:col-span-10 md:col-start-2"><div class="relative grid grid-cols-10 gap-x-4 gap-y-6 lg:gap-y-10"><div class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid gap-y-6 lg:gap-y-10"><div class="col-span-full lg:col-span-5"><div class="text-body-lg font-serif"><p class="text-callout home-v2-reason-title relative mb-4 mr-5 text-pretty font-sans"><span class="mr-5 xl:absolute xl:right-full xl:top-0 xl:mr-10 2xl:mr-16"><span class="inline-flex overflow-hidden"><span class="inline-block" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(1em);transition:opacity 800ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1), transform 1000ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1);transition-delay:0ms">0</span><span class="inline-block" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(1em);transition:opacity 800ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1), transform 1000ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1);transition-delay:80ms">6</span></span></span>Fin can resolve every customer issue, no matter how complex</p><p class="home-v2-reason-body text-current/80 text-pretty"><span class="block">Fin resolves incredibly <a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="/procedures">complex queries</a> for our thousands of customers, reading and writing to complicated 3rd party systems, and does so with ease.<!-- --> </span><span class="mt-4 block">Fin updates accounts, processes payments and refunds, troubleshoots technical issues, and much more.</span></p></div></div><div class="relative col-span-full overflow-hidden lg:col-span-7 xl:col-span-8"><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 66vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bg