ss="absolute size-2 bg-current top-0 left-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current top-0 right-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current bottom-0 left-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current bottom-0 right-0"></span></div></div><div class="relative hidden lg:block"><div class="aspect-video w-full"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-black/5"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="operator" class="relative grid scroll-mt-[130px] grid-cols-12 overflow-hidden py-10 lg:py-16" data-chapter-name="Operator" data-chapter-analytics-id="btn_home_chapter_operator" data-analytics-region="operator" data-analytics-id="sec_home_operator"><div class="md:px-0! container col-span-full md:col-span-10 md:col-start-2"><div class="relative grid grid-cols-10 gap-x-4 gap-y-6 lg:gap-y-10"><div class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid gap-y-6 lg:gap-y-10"><div class="col-span-full lg:col-span-5"><div class="text-body-lg font-serif"><p class="text-callout home-v2-reason-title relative mb-4 mr-5 text-pretty font-sans"><span class="mr-5 xl:absolute xl:right-full xl:top-0 xl:mr-10 2xl:mr-16"><span class="inline-flex overflow-hidden"><span class="inline-block" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(1em);transition:opacity 800ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1), transform 1000ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1);transition-delay:0ms">1</span><span class="inline-block" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(1em);transition:opacity 800ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1), transform 1000ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1);transition-delay:80ms">6</span></span></span>Fin runs your customer operations for you</p><p class="home-v2-reason-body text-current/80 text-pretty"><span class="block"><a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="/operator">Fin Operator</a> is an agent that runs your customer operations in a way that has never been possible before, orchestrating and automating the work behind the scenes.<!-- --> </span><span class="mt-4 block">Operator spots problems, finds opportunities to improve, and acts on them, for example tuning Fin, keeping your knowledge current, and scaling automation as your business changes.</span></p></div></div><div class="col-span-full lg:col-span-7 xl:col-span-8"><div class="relative"><div class="@container size-full"><div class="relative overflow-hidden @xl:aspect-998/561 aspect-square"><img alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2Fb6d33bc494b1ee90dad1b0a8212bf9b45b54ce43-1886x1061.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2Fb6d33bc494b1ee90dad1b0a8212bf9b45b54ce43-1886x1061.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2Fb6d33bc494b1ee90dad1b0a8212bf9b45b54ce43-1886x1061.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2Fb6d33bc494b1ee90dad1b0a8212bf9b45b54ce43-1886x1061.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2Fb6d33bc494b1ee90dad1b0a8212bf9b45b54ce43-1886x1061.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2Fb6d33bc494b1ee90dad1b0a8212bf9b45b54ce43-1886x1061.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2Fb6d33bc494b1ee90dad1b0a8212bf9b45b54ce43-1886x1061.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2Fb6d33bc494b1ee90dad1b0a8212bf9b45b54ce43-1886x1061.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2Fb6d33bc494b1ee90dad1b0a8212bf9b45b54ce43-1886x1061.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><div class="relative size-full"><div class="z-8 absolute inset-0 size-full overflow-hidden block @xl:hidden"></div><div class="z-8 absolute size-full overflow-hidden hidden @xl:block inset-0 w-auto h-auto"></div></div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" data-dot-decorators="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 m-3 xl:m-4 m-0! text-white/60 *:size-2"><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current top-0 left-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current top-0 right-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current bottom-0 left-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current bottom-0 right-0"></span></div></div></div><div class="col-span-full lg:col-span-3 lg:col-start-8 lg:self-end xl:col-span-2 xl:col-start-9"><span class="text-label-lg border-current/20 text-current/60 block border-t py-2">[ 16.A ]</span><p class="text-body text-current/60 mb-4 text-pretty">See how Operator detects an issue and ships a fix, start to finish.</p><div class="bg-fin/15 relative aspect-video lg:hidden"><div></div><div aria-hidden="true" data-dot-decorators="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 m-3 xl:m-4 m-0! z-20 text-white/60 *:size-2"><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current top-0 left-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current top-0 right-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current bottom-0 left-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current bottom-0 right-0"></span></div></div><div class="relative hidden lg:block"><div class="aspect-video w-full"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-black/5"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="blueprint" class="relative grid scroll-mt-[130px] grid-cols-12 overflow-hidden py-10 lg:py-16 pb-20 lg:pb-32" data-chapter-name="Blueprint" data-chapter-analytics-id="btn_home_chapter_blueprint" data-analytics-region="blueprint" data-analytics-id="sec_home_blueprint"><div class="md:px-0! container col-span-full md:col-span-10 md:col-start-2"><div class="relative grid grid-cols-10 gap-x-4 gap-y-6 lg:gap-y-10"><div class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid gap-y-6 lg:gap-y-10"><div class="col-span-full lg:col-span-5 lg:row-start-1"><div class="text-body-lg font-serif"><p class="text-callout home-v2-reason-title relative mb-4 mr-5 text-pretty font-sans"><span class="mr-5 xl:absolute xl:right-full xl:top-0 xl:mr-10 2xl:mr-16"><span class="inline-flex overflow-hidden"><span class="inline-block" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(1em);transition:opacity 800ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1), transform 1000ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1);transition-delay:0ms">1</span><span class="inline-block" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(1em);transition:opacity 800ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1), transform 1000ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1);transition-delay:80ms">7</span></span></span>Fin comes with the Blueprint for AI transformation</p><p class="home-v2-reason-body text-current/80 text-pretty"><span class="block">We can teach you what to do because we have fully transformed our own customer experience, and partnered with thousands of our customers to do the same.</span><span class="mt-4 block">We have encoded everything into a practical step-by-step guide called the <a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="/blueprint/service/introducing-ai-agents">Blueprint</a>, and we run <a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="https://luma.com/fin">Blueprint Events</a> to teach people in person.<!-- --> </span></p></div></div><div class="relative col-span-full lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-6 lg:row-start-1 lg:self-start"><img alt="The Fin Blueprint — a practical guide to transforming customer support with AI" loading="lazy" width="1956" height="1956" decoding="async" data-nimg=