s best-in-market results by partnering deeply with customers</p><p class="home-v2-reason-body text-current/80 text-pretty"><span class="block">Our <a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="/deployment-services">deployment team</a> works directly with customers to optimize for their bespoke requirements, ensuring they are getting the best results possible.<!-- --> </span><span class="mt-4 block">We see our customers as partners in this journey, and co-develop Fin in direct collaboration with the most forward thinking of them, to ensure we&#x27;re building the best product possible.</span></p></div></div><div class="col-span-full"><div class="relative"><div class="flex flex-col gap-y-6 lg:gap-y-10"><div class="flex gap-x-2"><button type="button" aria-label="Previous" disabled="" class="flex size-9 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-current/20 text-current transition-opacity hover:bg-current/5 disabled:cursor-default disabled:opacity-30"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-4 rotate-90"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.48 10a.25.25 0 0 1 .195.406l-3.48 4.35a.25.25 0 0 1-.39 0l-3.48-4.35A.25.25 0 0 1 8.52 10z"></path></svg></button><button type="button" aria-label="Next" disabled="" class="flex size-9 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-current/20 text-current transition-opacity hover:bg-current/5 disabled:cursor-default disabled:opacity-30"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="size-4 -rotate-90"><path fill="currentColor" d="M15.48 10a.25.25 0 0 1 .195.406l-3.48 4.35a.25.25 0 0 1-.39 0l-3.48-4.35A.25.25 0 0 1 8.52 10z"></path></svg></button></div><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="flex touch-pan-y touch-pinch-zoom"><div class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 basis-1/2 pr-4 md:basis-1/3 lg:basis-1/5"><figure class="flex flex-col gap-y-4"><div class="relative aspect-square ove