as much as we can, so others can learn.</span><span class="mt-4 block">We publish cutting edge, industry-first <a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="https://fin.ai/research/">AI Research papers</a>, and heavily cited <a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="https://www.intercom.com/customer-transformation-report">industry reports</a>.<!-- --> </span></p></div></div><div class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 px-12 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-4 sm:px-0 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="relative aspect-square w-full"><img alt="Fin for Sales" loading="lazy" width="800" height="800" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2Fa2792535c5fc069c7a74f82820b60d62309ae7ae-2049x2049.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2Fa2792535c5fc069c7a74f82820b60d62309ae7ae-2049x2049.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2Fa2792535c5fc069c7a74f82820b60d62309ae7ae-2049x2049.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75"/></div><p class="text-body text-pretty font-serif font-light">How We Built a World-Class Reranker <br/><a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" aria-label="Read more about How We Built a World-Class Reranker" href="https://fin.ai/research/how-we-built-a-world-class-reranker-for-fin/">Read more</a> </p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="relative aspect-square w-full"><img alt="Fin for Ecommerce" loading="lazy" width="800" height="800" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2F51850bd31da9b4c9899f04b00c832b4ba06ae213-2049x2049.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2F51850bd31da9b4c9899f04b00c832b4ba06ae213-2049x2049.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2F51850bd31da9b4c9899f04b00c832b4ba06ae213-2049x2049.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75"/></div><p class="text-body text-pretty font-serif font-light">Using LLMs as a Reranker for RAG<br/><a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" aria-label="Read more about Using LLMs as a Reranker for RAG" href="https://fin.ai/research/using-llms-as-a-reranker-for-rag-a-practical-guide/">Read more</a> </p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="relative aspect-square w-full"><img alt="Fin for Customer Service" loading="lazy" width="800" height="800" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2F00f50c3d3bebd170175104e091093ce02e60a8ae-2049x2049.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2F00f50c3d3bebd170175104e091093ce02e60a8ae-2049x2049.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2F00f50c3d3bebd170175104e091093ce02e60a8ae-2049x2049.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75"/></div><p class="text-body text-pretty font-serif font-light">Finetuning Retrieval for Fin<br/><a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" aria-label="Read more about Finetuning Retrieval for Fin" href="https://fin.ai/research/finetuning-retrieval-for-fin/">Read more</a> </p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="relative aspect-square w-full"><img alt="Fin for Success" loading="lazy" width="800" height="800" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2F4366622e23a950dc96d36ef57e537079b75ebaeb-2049x2049.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2F4366622e23a950dc96d36ef57e537079b75ebaeb-2049x2049.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2F4366622e23a950dc96d36ef57e537079b75ebaeb-2049x2049.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75"/></div><p class="text-body text-pretty font-serif font-light">Building out Intercom&#x27;s AI infra<br/><a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" aria-label="Read more about Building out Intercom&#x27;s AI infra" href="https://fin.ai/research/building-out-intercoms-ai-infra/">Read more</a> </p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="partners" class="relative grid scroll-mt-[130px] grid-cols-12 overflow-hidden py-10 lg:py-16" data-chapter-name="Partners" data-chapter-analytics-id="btn_home_chapter_partners" data-analytics-region="partners" data-analytics-id="sec_home_partners"><div class="md:px-0! container col-span-full md:col-span-10 md:col-start-2"><div class="relative grid grid-cols-10 gap-x-4 gap-y-6 lg:gap-y-10"><div class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid gap-y-6 lg:gap-y-10"><div class="col-span-full flex flex-col gap-y-6 lg:col-span-5 lg:gap-y-10"><div class="text-body-lg font-serif"><p class="text-callout home-v2-reason-title relative mb-4 mr-5 text-pretty font-sans"><span class="mr-5 xl:absolute xl:right-full xl:top-0 xl:mr-10 2xl:mr-16"><span class="inline-flex overflow-hidden"><span class="inline-block" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(1em);transition:opacity 800ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1), transform 1000ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1);transition-delay:0ms">2</span><span class="inline-block" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(1em);transition:opacity 800ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1), transform 1000ms cubic-bezier(0.33, 0, 0.25, 1);transition-delay:80ms">0</span></span></span>Fin events deliver world class thought leadership and education</p><p class="home-v2-reason-body text-current/80 text-pretty"><span class="block">In the age of AI, we are all hungry to learn from each other. We organise many events, big and small, spending a lot of time in person with our customers so we can build the future together.</span><span class="mt-4 block">We teach them what we know, we learn from what they are doing, and very importantly, we help them connect and learn from each other.</span></p></div></div><div class="col-span-full"><section data-analytics-region="carousel" data-analytics-id="sec_home_carousel"><div class="relative"><div class="grid grid-cols-10 gap-x-4 gap-y-8 lg:gap-y-8"><div class="col-span-full lg:col-span-8"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="flex touch-pan-y touch-pinch-zoom"><div class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 basis-full"><div class="relative aspect-square overflow-hidden md:aspect-auto"><img alt="Fin taking action across business systems" loading="lazy" width="1280" height="720" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full w-full object-cover md:h-auto" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2F356794dbc3cf6f8138f56c781a42ad4453a92ad7-2976x1888.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2F356794dbc3cf6f8138f56c781a42ad4453a92ad7-2976x1888.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2F4bgok82s%2Fmonorepo-static-assets%2F356794dbc3cf6f8138f56c781a42ad4453a92ad7-2976x1888.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><div aria-hidden="true" data-dot-decorators="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 m-3 xl:m-4 m-0! text-white/60 *:size-2"><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current top-0 left-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current top-0 right-0"><