003e\"],\"-FqRfc\":[\"Hear why Anthropic chose Fin over building their own AI solution.\"],\"-ILTCO\":[\"Fin Operator is an agent that runs your customer operations, orchestrating and automating the work behind the scenes. It spots problems, finds opportunities to improve and acts on them, tuning Fin, keeping knowledge current and scaling automation as your business changes.\"],\"-KhLe9\":[\"Low latency,\u003c0/\u003e\u003c1\u003ehigh accuracy\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"-M9Kun\":[\"Every role\"],\"-OgHhM\":[\"Constantina Samara, VP Customer Support at Synthesia\"],\"-UAV0Q\":[\"Fin Product Demo\"],\"-UGjce\":[\"Fin lets you measure and monitor everything in your customer experience and operations, with alerts on what matters most. AI-powered Insights and QA products surface dominant and emergent trends, plus one-click recommendations to improve performance.\"],\"-bVtxO\":[\"Connect Fin to your tools and data\"],\"-f9Jcl\":[\"Previous video\"],\"-kOtsE\":[\"We are now pioneering the next big leap, making perfect customer experiences truly possible across the entire customer journey.\"],\"-mNwru\":[\"About us\"],\"-t3YMk\":[\"Home\"],\"-t_Yv8\":[\"How your customers reach Fin\"],\"-tide_\":[\"Fin for scale: \"],\"-vO4Hn\":[\"Team performance and coaching\"],\"-xTo9E\":[\"Fin with your \u003c0/\u003e current helpdesk\"],\"02Owsj\":[\"Try the highest performing AI Agent for every conversation\"],\"03X2CD\":[\"Hold space to talk\"],\"09fg4f\":[\"Trusted by thousands of customer service leaders\"],\"0GbyD8\":[\"Advanced AI features to analyze performance, monitor quality, and improve Fin, plus Operator, an agent for your customer operations.\"],\"0Y57py\":[\"Fin Academy\"],\"0fH4XA\":[\"1-15\"],\"0jSD09\":[\"AI engine\"],\"0jgq_5\":[\"Fin Voice works with your existing telephony setup and all major providers - including Twilio, Genesys, RingCentral, Five9, 8x8, Aircall, and Mitel - so you can get started quickly with simple call-forwarding, or choose a deeper SIP integration for more control. Beyond telephony, Fin connects to your business systems through Intercom's Actions framework and data connectors to access customer data, process refunds, update subscriptions, and check order status in real time during calls. You can start with a single phone line before scaling to your full call volume.\"],\"0knFgz\":[\"Learn more about Operator’s technical architecture and the engineering choices we’ve made.\"],\"0mL2uK\":[\"There was definitely anxiety the first time we left Fin running overnight — and it handled everything without missing a beat.\"],\"0uMN0i\":[\"Drill into recordings, transcripts, and answer logic to understand why Fin responded the way it did - and fine-tune until it's right.\"],\"0vlDyW\":[\"Fin combines its training with customer history and context to do the right thing for the customer and business, every single time.\"],\"10F060\":[\"Looking to switch support platforms?\"],\"1B9XX0\":[\"Process\"],\"1Cb6U1\":[\"Value that compounds\"],\"1DD-a7\":[\"Your voice session ended unexpectedly. Please try again.\"],\"1K4yli\":[\"privacy check icon\"],\"1OlqTP\":[\"See what Fin Voice can do for your customer experience\"],\"1R7S8m\":[\"Fin Voice is offered on a custom pricing plan. It's currently available to select customers working directly with our sales team. If you're interested in Fin Voice, please [contact our sales team](https://fin.ai/contact-sales) to discuss your needs and receive tailored pricing details.\"],\"1Tg9b1\":[\"Apex model\"],\"1UKW5D\":[\"Operator helps you QA responses, manage teammate performance, and coordinate incidents - surfacing what's important and giving you a way to act, without hours of manual work.\"],\"1ZaQUH\":[\"Last name\"],\"1aLbUH\":[\"Your company size\"],\"1c_hy2\":[\"Fin determines that a prospect doesn’t match your qualification criteria and disqualifies them accordingly.\"],\"1ctk0y\":[\"\u003c0\u003eFin Operator\u003c/0\u003e is an agent that runs your customer operations in a way that has never been possible before, orchestrating and automating the work behind the scenes.\"],\"1eUHES\":[\"Fin Voice is an AI voice agent that brings Fin's unrivaled performance to phone support. It runs on Apex Flash - our latest Fin model, built for latency-sensitive tasks - so calls feel fast, accurate, and natural. Fin answers calls instantly, holds natural conversations, and resolves issues end-to-end without IVR menus or long hold times, including complex, multi-step queries handled through Procedures. Using your knowledge base, Fin Voice provides accurate, contextual answers 24/7 and seamlessly passes calls to a human agent when needed. Every conversation feels natural, on-brand, and reflective of your support policies.\"],\"1jl_RC\":[\"Discover what Fin can do for your customer service\"],\"1k4N5X\":[\"This is an interactive demo of a travel agency using Fin Voice 2.\"],\"1rQS3A\":[\"Fin comes with the industry's most comprehensive features \u0026 capabilities that allow you to continuously improve Fin's performance over time.\"],\"1wIPDO\":[\"Fin Voice runs on Apex Flash - built for latency-sensitive tasks. Accurate, natural responses that resolve complex queries end-to-end and keep your phone operation easier to manage.\"],\"2-ExvJ\":[\"WhatsApp\"],\"20WsUt\":[\"Loading form...\"],\"22hh0W\":[\"Analyze Fin with AI-powered insights.\"],\"2CeIIj\":[\"Real-time tool calling\"],\"2FoHU3\":[\"Resolve\"],\"2H7Yb_\":[\"Your Privacy Choices\"],\"2MtpHK\":[\"See our recent product updates\"],\"2PwdBa\":[\"Describe it. Operator builds it.\"],\"2R0JWw\":[\"Return on investment\"],\"2avJoh\":[\"Fin works best on Intercom\"],\"2fJHV9\":[\"What is Fin Voice and how does it work?\"],\"2mv_sz\":[\"Learn more about outcomes.\"],\"2oehXF\":[\"Fin Pricing\"],\"2qZIio\":[\"What is the Fin Flywheel?\"],\"2vhFy4\":[\"\u003c0\u003eThe most natural, powerful voice agent \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003efor customer experience.\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"3-BGVM\":[\"[Procedures](https://fin.ai/procedures) let Fin handle complex queries with multiple steps, business logic, third party systems, or cross-team approvals. You combine natural language instructions with deterministic controls to create Procedures that follow your exact rules when needed, so Fin can resolve multi-step queries accurately and reliably rather than just answering simple questions.\"],\"34cyfE\":[\"Powered by our new model Fin Apex Flash - the fastest, highest-performing model for voice.\"],\"39AZG3\":[\"What payment methods are accepted?\"],\"39JQw_\":[\"Calculate your ROI with Fin\"],\"3AVbsg\":[\"Join the companies transforming their operations with Fin\"],\"3C9yw0\":[\"Policy configuration for communication style and context guidance\"],\"3JtfpK\":[\"Audience-specific responses\"],\"3TVC12\":[\"Leader on G2\"],\"3aGIRB\":[\"Fin AI Agent is an advanced AI Agent that provides fast, accurate answers to customers 24/7 via live chat, email, SMS, WhatsApp, social and more. Fin is the [highest-performing AI Agent](https://fin.ai/benchmarks) in customer service, delivering higher-quality answers and resolving more complex queries than any other AI Agent.\\n\\nFin is powered by the patented Fin AI Engine™, an AI architecture specifically engineered for customer service. Every layer is optimized for precision, speed, and reliability, so Fin can resolve more conversations, more effectively than competing AI Agents.\\n\\nAll Intercom plans include access to Fin, and pricing is simple: $\",[\"0\"],\" per outcome.\\n\\n[Learn more about Fin AI Agent](https://fin.ai/customer-agent).\"],\"3fPjUY\":[\"Pro\"],\"3hJypY\":[\"Insights\"],\"3keP-S\":[\"This vision requires three things that only Fin can provide:\"],\"3lYlV4\":[\"Increased resolution:\"],\"3lkBe4\":[\"Fin AI agent will save you\"],\"3ls5Ra\":[\"Fin in action\"],\"3w0-16\":[\"Pay only when Fin delivers value. No setup, integration, or platform fees.\"],\"4-JaWo\":[\"Start free trial\"],\"45lf99\":[\"Start Fin Voice demo\"],\"49sNLc\":[\"omnichannel\"],\"4DyXko\":[\"Fin meets customers where they are, working natively across all channels including Voice, Chat, email, Slack and social. Fin over Voice uses Apex Flash, a model designed for low-latency interactions that feel natural.\"],\"4MxL6E\":[\"Choose a voice that fits your brand and define the policies Fin will follow. Fin delivers that experience on every call, without the variation and retraining challenges of large call-center teams.\"],\"4QNZuQ\":[\"Fin over API\"],\"4Un5xv\":[\"Freshdesk\"],\"4Y5H-g\":[\"Terms\"],\"4bZwog\":[\"Delivers perfect customer service\"],\"4e_CeC\":[\"Built For You\"],\"4fNHzk\":[\"Monthly support volume\"],\"4kI4Ge\":[\"Watch the product demo\"],\"4vqkQ-\":[\"Fin's groundbreaking AI research is public by default\"],\"4zVGzF\":[\"Agents freed\"],\"5-JTLe\":[\"Key features include:\"],\"50_M9q\":[\"Fin keeps getting better the more it is used. Currently at 2 million weekly resolutions and growing fast, the average resolution rate increases 1% every month.\"],\"50rx07\":[\"Company Logo\"],\"56FbAD\":[\"Convert and retain shoppers\"],\"5A3ujh\":[\"ParkBee\"],\"5CCEPU\":[\"We can teach you what to do because we have fully transformed our own customer experience, and partnered with thousands of our customers to do the same.\"],\"5Ef0bw\":[\"Run fully simulated customer conversations from start to finish to test how Fin will respond. You can see what Fin is doing, when it is reasoning, and where it passes or fails.\"],\"5H7LM9\":[\"Purpose-built for customer service\"],\"5Kf5uk\":[\"Our Sales team will be in touch soon. Watch a full product demo while you wait.\"],\"5ZfO1h\":[\"Operator introduction\"],\"5_j-43\":[\"All your Simulations live in a central library. When products or policies change and Procedures are updated, just hit Run all to check if anything has regressed or broken.\"],\"5etEGq\":[\"Fin Voice 2 is powered by Apex Flash, our newest model built for voice. Higher resolution rates, more natural calls, and complex queries resolved end-to-end.\"],\"5lWFkC\":[\"Sign in\"],\"5pG32u\":[\"Operator detects conversation spikes as they happen, identifies every affected conversation, and helps you respond in bulk. Hours of manual triage become a few decisions.\"],\"5w_eK-\":[\"For customers who sign up and pay online, we accept all major credit cards. To pay via ACH or wire, please contact our sales team.\\n\\nPlease note: Intercom is billed in United States Dollars (USD) only.\"],\"60fUoE\":[\"Watch the Operator launch keynote\"],\"63-o0O\":[\"Our deployment team works directly with customers to optimise for their bespoke requirements. We see customers as partners and co-develop Fin in direct collaboration with the most forward-thinking of them.\"],\"63FzGa\":[\"API, MCP \u0026 data integrations\"],\"6BGWw9\":[\"Apply for 93% off\"],\"6BsS3F\":[\"Call again\"],\"6MTk51\":[\"Watch the latest updates on Procedures.\"],\"6PXhNX\":[\"What are Operator credits?\"],\"6UBWF1\":[\"Compared with the previous version of Fin Voice, which ran on general-purpose models, Fin Voice 2 delivers:\"],\"6gswhT\":[\"Resolves complex queries\u003c0/\u003e\u003c1\u003eend-to-end\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"6jNkAd\":[\"Operator analyzes your conversations as they happen - surfacing patterns, themes, and emerging issues directly from the conversations themselves.\"],\"6lGV3K\":[\"Show less\"],\"6s2C6T\":[\"Fin is pioneering the \u003c0\u003eCustomer Agent\u003c/0\u003e, a single customer facing Agent that works across the customer journey, from day 1 to year 10.\"],\"6swYjh\":[\"Fin Voice exceeded our expectations, allowing us to keep phone support running 24/7 without needing to staff agents outside business hours. Customers often tell us they're amazed it's not a real person - \u003c0\u003eFin Voice sounds natural, responds in context, and doesn't feel robotic at all.\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"6yfN2Z\":[\"Back to the previous step\"],\"72XlBL\":[\"We organise many events, big and small, spending time in person with customers to build the future together. We teach what we know, learn from what they are doing, and help them connect and learn from each other.\"],\"72c5Qo\":[\"Total\"],\"78DQ5b\":[\"Simulation library\"],\"7EThex\":[\"Credit Repair Cloud\"],\"7NsMuV\":[\"\u003c0\u003eLet's get your\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1/\u003eFin demo started\"],\"7TkjAs\":[\"Play video\"],\"7ULHrv\":[\"Business Manager, Growth Product\"],\"7WS-cT\":[\"Intercom has every feature your team needs to resolve queries faster, deliver personalized service, engage proactively, and continuously improve your customer experience.\"],\"7ZnOqF\":[\"end-to-end\"],\"7dOKqH\":[\"Natural interruption handling\"],\"7i8j3G\":[\"Company\"],\"7kF0Ik\":[\"Get started with Operator\"],\"7nctd5\":[\"Female voice. Speaks American English.\"],\"7oC9pp\":[\"About Fin (formerly Intercom). Fin is the Customer Agent company delivering perfect customer experiences from support to sales to commerce.\"],\"7psc6N\":[\"Director, Deployment Services\"],\"7uq0Ot\":[\"Deep telephony integration\"],\"7vHSY3\":[\"Discover what Fin can do for your inbound sales\"],\"83iZdj\":[\"Join Pioneer on October 7th to explore how CX leaders are redefining what's possible.\"],\"84kxAP\":[\"Where is my order?\"],\"8BL8_i\":[\"Inspect every answer\"],\"8FAOMN\":[\"AI Engineering Manager\"],\"8FkB-u\":[\"\u003c0\u003e0.6 seconds \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003efaster time to first token\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"8JMx24\":[\"Financial Services\"],\"8KWjec\":[\"Fin connects to all your systems, pulling in customer data, personalising responses and taking actions via API, Data Connectors or MCP. Extend Fin with custom actions, workflows and integrations through a fully documented API platform.\"],\"8ScMNo\":[\"Thanks to our investment in building an easy to use product, Fin can be live with any helpdesk in less than an hour.\"],\"8VS4PT\":[\"Fin matches a prospect to a routing outcome marked as Self-serve, for example, directing them to sign up for a trial.\"],\"8f1RcD\":[\"Your team manages Fin from one unified system. Update your knowledge base, guidance, or rules once and they apply everywhere automatically.\"],\"8hckxv\":[\"Operator illustration\"],\"8iM8R5\":[\"Microphone access needed\"],\"8jQ-5X\":[\"#1 AI Agent today\"],\"8k8mKz\":[\"Couldn't connect\"],\"8klfT6\":[\"Custom AI Scorecards\"],\"8ns0KJ\":[\"If you sign up for Fin and are not 100% satisfied in your first 90 days, \u003c0\u003ewe will give you up to $1M\u003c/0\u003e of your money back, no questions asked.\"],\"8oy28S\":[\"Train Fin to resolve the most complex queries\"],\"8vw8g3\":[\"Fin empowers you to measure and monitor everything happening within your customer experience and operations, and get alerted to the things you care about most.\"],\"8yXTNp\":[\"per helpdesk seat \u003c0/\u003eper month\"],\"8z8KBJ\":[\"Operator preps 1:1 briefs, spots coaching opportunities, and helps you understand what’s behind a performance dip - whether it’s caseload, topic assignment, or a gap in knowledge.\"],\"8zKy11\":[\"Fin invented and championed outcome-based pricing\"],\"9-q6lV\":[\"Fin has a full testing suite to give you confidence before setting changes live\"],\"95GvX8\":[\"Fin Voice 2\"],\"95r17U\":[\"Listening...\"],\"98lL6O\":[\"Contact sales to accept the offer\"],\"9C_kyn\":[\"How does Fin improve over time?\"],\"9FBEvL\":[\"Senior Director, R\u0026D Services\"],\"9H68fw\":[\"The 22 reasons businesses choose Fin as their AI Customer Agent, spanning performance, proprietary AI models, channels, helpdesk integrations, trust and security, customization, pricing and vision.\"],\"9MB6NT\":[\"Chief Digital Officer at [solidcore]\"],\"9SORvN\":[\"Fin works across the entire customer journey\"],\"9YA0km\":[\"AI Agent Blueprint\"],\"9Zcd7g\":[\"Apply now\"],\"9cMtYw\":[\"20+ updates for\u003c0/\u003e\u003c1\u003eexceptional phone support\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"9gYDkF\":[\"Fin Voice simulated end-to-end complex query handling test\"],\"9jF0iJ\":[\"Fin can handle every role, from \u003c0\u003eService\u003c/0\u003e to \u003c1\u003eSales\u003c/1\u003e, using pre-trained skills and knowledge.\"],\"9m3dcr\":[\"What is Fin AI Agent?\"],\"9mM6gQ\":[\"Fin works on any helpdesk\"],\"9p2kgA\":[\"Call performance dashboards\"],\"9q29c8\":[\"Fin integrates seamlessly with any platform, whether you're using Intercom or another customer support solution. Set it up in under an hour and start resolving tickets, cases, emails, and messages across every channel, right out of the box.\\n\\nYou can use Fin with:\\n\\n- Intercom\\n- [Salesforce](https://fin.ai/integrations/salesforce)\\n- [HubSpot](https://fin.ai/integrations/hubspot)\\n- [Freshworks](https://fin.ai/integrations/freshdesk)\\n- Dixa\\n- Front\\n- Zoho\\n- Sprinklr\\n- Gorgias\\n\\nPlus, we support additional platforms and custom [channels](https://fin.ai/channels).\"],\"9q36B3\":[\"Meet Fin Voice. The most natural, powerful voice agent, for customer experience.\"],\"9s1SEt\":[\"Select your monthly support volume to continue.\"],\"9td1Wl\":[\"Check\"],\"9uN1L8\":[\"View Demos\"],\"9upP5w\":[\"Natural voices that sound like your \u003c0\u003ebrand \",[\"0\"],\"\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"A29QTB\":[\"Absolutely. Choose from an expanded library of natural voices and accents, set personalized greetings that adjust by office hours, and define how Fin should handle calls it can't resolve - whether that's a live transfer, callback, or workflow handoff. You can also configure when Fin asks clarifying questions and which topics it should immediately escalate, ensuring every interaction stays on-brand and reflects your support policies.\"],\"A4_7E2\":[\"What is Copilot?\"],\"ABf1O-\":[\"AI call summaries\"],\"ADvOWu\":[\"Fin for HubSpot\"],\"AHZflp\":[\"Chat\"],\"AMEJbs\":[\"\u003c0\u003eDeeper insights, higher call quality, \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003emore control\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"AO6JDh\":[\"Operator can configure any Fin feature on your behalf - no need to learn how each one works or train your team on the setup. Just describe what you need, and it handles the rest.\"],\"AOvXrz\":[\"Thanks!\"],\"AP7bS8\":[\"Only pay when Fin resolves the issue end to end, or successfully executes a Procedure you've configured to end in a handoff to a human or a workflow.\"],\"ARZP6R\":[\"Join us at Pioneer, Oct 7.\"],\"AZYaFU\":[\"Pronounces your brand terms correctly.\"],\"AdCk9d\":[\"Fin \u003c0\u003econnects to all your systems\u003c/0\u003e, pulling in customer data, personalising responses, and taking actions via API, Data Connectors, or MCP.\"],\"Alp2ti\":[\"Contact Sales\"],\"AyPlPI\":[\"Can I pay in my local currency?\"],\"B1MDds\":[\"Operations\"],\"BDmt0f\":[\"Fin is trained to understand your business goals, policies, rules, guidelines and operating procedures, enabling it to resolve complex multi-step workflows via Procedures. It communicates in your brand voice, speaks dozens of languages and works 24 hours a day.\"],\"BQ1UvS\":[\"Your operation has problems you don't know about, patterns you'd never spot, and opportunities you'd never think to look for. Operator surfaces them all and helps you act on them.\"],\"BUmfWg\":[\"What are Fin Procedures?\"],\"B_Vthx\":[\"each\"],\"BcZrDz\":[\"Fin performs best because it runs on our proprietary AI Models\"],\"BhB6Pl\":[\"Brand voice selection\"],\"Bl5UgQ\":[\"Complete, fully configurable AI Agent system. Train Fin on your Procedures, knowledge, and policies, test performance before launch, deploy across every channel, then analyze and improve with AI-powered Insights.\"],\"Bt2cSM\":[\"CX Score\"],\"Bu0F54\":[\"Analyze Fin with AI-powered Insights\"],\"BxpGcg\":[\"Fin connects to any system\"],\"C2SYi-\":[\"Help Center\"],\"C5-bSh\":[\"Do you offer discounts for startups?\"],\"C576qM\":[\"A member of the team will be in touch shortly\"],\"C8pqIJ\":[\"A 14-day free trial is the fastest way for your company to get started.\"],\"CA54HS\":[\"Agent for your customer operations\"],\"CAuTFx\":[\"The Fin Flywheel is the continuous improvement loop that powers how Fin gets better over time. It runs in four stages: [Train](https://fin.ai/train) Fin on your Procedures, knowledge, and policies; [Test](https://fin.ai/testing) performance with simulated conversations before going live; [Deploy](https://fin.ai/channels) across every channel your customers use; then [Analyze](https://fin.ai/analyze) results with AI-powered Insights to find gaps and improve. Each stage feeds into the next, so every conversation Fin handles makes the next one more accurate.\"],\"CEZHX4\":[\"Fin is built with trust, safety and reliability at the core\"],\"CIwIfK\":[\"Fin supports your customers directly in Slack communities and Connect channels. Replies are instant, stay threaded, and feel native to Slack.\"],\"CL6z--\":[\"\u003c0\u003eApex Flash has spiked our Fin Voice resolution rate.\u003c/0\u003e Conversations sound more natural, and Fin Voice is doing more for us than ever as we head into our busiest season.\"],\"CMKD_x\":[\"Open guarantee information dialog\"],\"CRzGla\":[\"Help center\"],\"CTWsuc\":[\"Instagram\"],\"CU_wPF\":[\"Contact Fin Sales Team\"],\"CUzOgH\":[\"Configure Fin's tone, behavior, and knowledge without needing engineering resources on your own\"],\"CcGOj-\":[\"Copilot\"],\"CdpZk6\":[\"Writes like your team\"],\"CjV34H\":[\"Fin Capabilities\"],\"CkNz7b\":[\"Fin is a complete AI Agent System that empowers teams to transform their business with AI and deliver consistent, high-quality support at scale without increasing headcount.\"],\"CvGPhW\":[\"Annual cost per employee\"],\"Czg9qN\":[\"Fin with the \u003c0/\u003e Intercom helpdesk\"],\"D4v8Ac\":[\"Eligibility criteria:\"],\"D5hmL6\":[\"Does Fin work with our existing helpdesk?\"],\"DDPXLY\":[\"Employee cost\"],\"DFFB2t\":[\"Contact sales\"],\"DHhJ7s\":[\"Previous\"],\"DPtG0S\":[\"FIN MILLION DOLLAR GUARANTEE\"],\"DRj3d4\":[\"Watch interactive demos of Fin AI Agent in action. See how Fin resolves customer queries, integrates with your systems, and delivers exceptional support.\"],\"DUjfwN\":[\"Automatic call categorization\"],\"DWGfva\":[\"Fin for industries: \"],\"DfQ0Xj\":[\"Principal Customer Experience Architect\"],\"DgfWcx\":[\"What integrations does Fin Voice work with?\"],\"DgpRXL\":[\"Your session ended after losing connection. Please try again.\"],\"DhxZI7\":[\"Knowledge base answers\"],\"Dn8VN2\":[\"Meet\"],\"DoQfy_\":[\"Add Fin to your existing setup\"],\"E3XnLI\":[\"\u003c0\u003eGet started with\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eFin Voice\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"E4B4Vb\":[\", \"],\"E51akL\":[\"Deployment services\"],\"EFN4p8\":[\"We looked at a few different vendors, including in-house options. Some had flashy demos, but required engineers for every change. \u003c0\u003eI needed control — and Fin gave me that.\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"EIaMre\":[\"Fin can issue refunds, update records, look up account details, and verify information by seamlessly connecting to your APIs.\"],\"ENUN4p\":[\"Operator is an agent that runs your customer operations. It spots problems, finds opportunities to improve, and it acts on them – tuning Fin, keeping your knowledge current, and scaling automation as your business changes. One agent for understanding, managing, and improving your customer experience in a way that has never been possible before.\"],\"EP0rn4\":[\"brand\"],\"ESmYeU\":[\"AI Technology\"],\"EXLBE4\":[\"Speak to Fin Voice\"],\"EXv5oB\":[\"See the impact Fin could\u003c0/\u003e have on your business\"],\"EY4XTR\":[\"Operator is included in the Pro add-on. Credits are the unit used to measure and charge for Operator usage. Every Pro workspace receives monthly credits, and the number of credits included scales with conversation volume. If you use more credits than what's included in Pro, you can buy additional credits at $\",[\"0\"],\" per credit. You can track usage, set alerts, and use hard limits to control spend.\"],\"Ed99mE\":[\"Thinking...\"],\"EgZAPP\":[\"Female voice. Speaks Australian English.\"],\"EhfIwR\":[\"Call forwarding setup\"],\"EkD_b8\":[\"If you sign up for our Fin Guarantee Success Program, and do not achieve at least a resolution rate of 65%, \u003c0\u003ewe will pay you $1M\u003c/0\u003e. This program is designed for high volume customers.\"],\"EkH9pt\":[\"Update\"],\"EuQswH\":[\"Fin home (opens in a new tab)\"],\"Ev5qq2\":[\"Knowledge\"],\"F-vBv0\":[\"Ask\"],\"F1jcrC\":[\"✨ Interactive Demo\"],\"F99pY4\":[\"Learn about Operator and what it can do for your team.\"],\"FFv0Vh\":[\"Automation\"],\"FI4Mh2\":[\"Meet our customers\"],\"FJUsFy\":[\"Which helpdesks does Fin AI Agent integrate with?\"],\"FLOYxh\":[\"Operator keeps your knowledge base perfectly up to date by identifying the exact content your team needs to create, update or remove, then drafting it for you, making it effortless to keep your agent's source of truth accurate.\"],\"FN4o9V\":[\"Our fastest model yet\"],\"FPo0K0\":[\"Fin delivering a consistent experience across phone, chat, and messaging\"],\"FSDLVC\":[\"Fin speaks dozens of languages, and works 24 hours a day, every day.\"],\"FdplGg\":[\"Train Fin on your Procedures, knowledge, and policies, so it follows your rules and resolves complex, multi-step queries accurately and reliably.\"],\"FfqJGo\":[\"Fin communicates like your best employee, because it understands your brand voice, brand messaging, communication style, and anything else you want to teach it.\"],\"Fim4Hm\":[\"Fin hands off to your human team effortlessly, maintaining full customer context. It is natively integrated with Intercom and works with Salesforce, Hubspot, Freshdesk and many other helpdesks, and can be live in less than an hour.\"],\"FmFc80\":[\"You could be eligible for our Early Stage Program: 93% off Intercom and Fin, free for 12 months.\"],\"FmN5me\":[\"Resolution\"],\"G2y_xl\":[\"How is Operator priced?\"],\"GFMswk\":[\"Recommended for your company\"],\"GJSWVb\":[\"Weak connection detected, conversation quality may be reduced.\"],\"GLUC2q\":[\"Deploy\"],\"GUk6Mt\":[\"Fin Voice is a radically better experience for every caller. It delivers instant, natural conversations that feel human and never lose context. Fin Voice is simple to set up, easy to preview, and works with all major telephony systems.\"],\"GWbbkP\":[\"Copilot is an AI-powered assistant in your inbox that helps customer support agents quickly find answers, troubleshoot issues, and respond to follow-up questions, saving time and allowing them to build stronger customer relationships.\\n\\nYou can add Copilot for $\",[\"0\"],\" per user per month (subject to the Additional Product Terms for AI Products). Copilot is currently available for Salesforce.\\n\\n[Learn more about Copilot](https://www.intercom.com/suite/helpdesk/copilot).\"],\"GXofvq\":[\"Fin works seamlessly with every helpdesk\"],\"G__hu8\":[\"Simple, outcome-\u003c0/\u003ebased pricing.\"],\"Ge4aDS\":[\"A summit on Oct 7 where CX leaders redefine what's possible\"],\"GpB8YV\":[\"Enterprise\"],\"Gx3jo0\":[\"on every call\"],\"GyXo4y\":[\"You need a single Customer Agent to deliver seamless experiences\"],\"H62dGU\":[\"When something changes, just tell Operator. It finds every article and internal doc affected, drafts the updates, and puts them in front of you for review.\"],\"H8MBV1\":[\"/mo\"],\"H94JBK\":[\"features\"],\"H9zK7E\":[\"Apex and Apex Flash are the highest performing, fastest, and cheapest models for customer experience.\"],\"HF6C2L\":[\"Phone Number\"],\"HGhDHm\":[\"Before launch, you run fully simulated customer conversations from start to finish with [Simulations](https://fin.ai/testing) to see exactly how Fin will behave. You can watch what Fin is doing, when it is reasoning, and where it passes or fails. Save your Simulations to a central library and rerun them whenever you update a Procedure, so you catch anything that regressed before it reaches your customers.\"],\"HMciv_\":[\"Get a year of Fin + \",[\"0\"],\"% off Intercom\"],\"HW9YzN\":[\"Year 2\"],\"HqMw8r\":[\"Fin has the reliability global enterprises depend on, and the certs you expect: SOC2 and ISO 27001, ISO 42001 and AIUC-1, ISO 27701 and HIPAA.\"],\"HvkRYs\":[\"Handles inbound sales end-to-end\"],\"Hvzj0d\":[\"Fin tracking performance in real time\"],\"HwKJRn\":[\"AI Sentiment Report 2026\"],\"I0z10h\":[\"Actions and thinking log\"],\"I1dP7o\":[\"Fin performs best because it runs on our proprietary AI models\"],\"I6gOLZ\":[\"Built natively into the Intercom Helpdesk\"],\"IMuaTN\":[\"Guide to launching \u0026 scaling AI in customer service and sales\"],\"IZDhtF\":[\"Fin replies instantly from your domain, in your brand voice, with clarity and accuracy, making email as fast and reliable as any other support channel.\"],\"IeHW4w\":[\"Fin is designed to go live quickly when your content is already in place. It connects directly to your existing knowledge sources, help center articles, and support workflows, so there is no migration or rebuild required. Teams with content ready to go can typically deploy within hours, not weeks.\"],\"IewBrD\":[\"We have adopted a simple model to strike a balance between affordability and sustainability:\\n\\n- $\",[\"0\"],\" per Fin outcome.\\n- Minimum commitments apply.\\n- Unlimited teammates – No additional seat costs.\\n\\nThere are no additional costs, such as integration fees, setup fees, or platform charges.\\n\\nYou can add Copilot to any integration for $\",[\"1\"],\" per month (subject to the Additional Product Terms for AI Products).\\n\\n[Learn more about outcome pricing](https://www.intercom.com/help/en/articles/8205718-fin-ai-agent-outcomes).\"],\"ImK3F4\":[\"Topics Explorer groups every customer conversation into Topics and Subtopics. Spot patterns, track trends, and catch issues before they impact customer experience.\"],\"IuyKD2\":[\"Transfers to agents directly in preferred Inbox\"],\"J28zul\":[\"Connecting...\"],\"J4xOdE\":[\"Most voice AI follows the same pattern: convert speech to text, process it with a general model, then convert the answer back into speech. It adds latency and delivers answers from a model that wasn't built for customer service.\"],\"J74m_P\":[\"Prefilled from details you gave earlier.\"],\"J7rtpf\":[\"No of customer support employees\"],\"J89MVR\":[\"You've reached your session limit. Please try again in a few minutes.\"],\"J9Prux\":[\"Fin managed from one unified system across every channel\"],\"JEtpkj\":[\"One agent for understanding, managing, and improving your customer experience in a way that has never been possible before.\"],\"JGWe3Q\":[\"Ask Operator about a conversation that was handed off too early, or where a rule got missed. It’ll pinpoint the cause and help you ship the fix, so no other customer has the same issue.\"],\"JKFkHK\":[\"Director of Support at Consensys\"],\"JRlgV1\":[\"Intercom [launched Fin] with a disruptive outcome-based pricing model, which they launched in early 2023...\u003c0\u003ea year ahead of most competitors.\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"JXI9jt\":[\"\u003c0\u003eManage your human support operation,\u003c/0\u003e effortlessly\"],\"Jc1jCx\":[\"Fin has a full testing suite to run simulations, regression testing and manual inspection, so you can understand how changes will work in production and at scale before setting them live.\"],\"Jcopsb\":[\"Please allow microphone access in your browser settings to use Fin Voice.\"],\"JdMp7P\":[\"Blueprint\"],\"JeApBy\":[\"As of June 2026, we have already shipped 191 this year. We are on track to 3x our productivity, thanks to our deep investment in \u003c0\u003eAI engineering\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"JpU2bU\":[\"Data Connectors enable Fin to securely retrieve data and take action in external systems like Shopify, Stripe, and Salesforce.\"],\"JxgXH1\":[\"Per month\"],\"K3EdmX\":[\"The same experience, \u003c0\u003eon every channel\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"K47k8R\":[\"Product\"],\"K6n9JS\":[\"Messenger\"],\"KAXSwC\":[\"Voice\"],\"KGWvIp\":[\"A bright orange, glossy, tube-like shape looping and intertwining into a symmetrical, flower-like knot\"],\"KHPIwk\":[\"Fin Voice\"],\"KKvtdb\":[\"Fin runs on Apex 1.0 and Apex Flash, models custom-trained on billions of customer experience interactions. They are the highest performing, fastest and cheapest models for customer experience, with sophisticated checks and balances to ensure accurate answers.\"],\"KO6gjB\":[\"22 reasons\u003c0/\u003eto hire Fin\"],\"KVfNy3\":[\"Operator automation backdrop\"],\"K_43Vv\":[\"See Fin in action resolving complex customer service queries with the highest quality answers.\"],\"KbQI90\":[\"Offer ends on July 31st\"],\"Kfcliy\":[\"The technology behind Fin\"],\"Koof6k\":[\"A 14-day free trial is the fastest way to get started.\"],\"KrPiGu\":[\"Define how Fin behaves on every call\"],\"KsSMBz\":[\"Fin improves at a rapid pace. In 2025 we shipped 226 product updates, and as of June 2026 we have already shipped 191 this year, on track to 3x our productivity thanks to deep investment in AI engineering.\"],\"L2PjIs\":[\"Manage usage with configurable alerts, limits, and real time reporting.\"],\"LIBVn7\":[\"One-click recommendations\"],\"LL8vVp\":[\"Read more about Building out Intercom's AI infra\"],\"LQPRk8\":[\"Staff AI Agent Engineer\"],\"LQh3rC\":[\"AI Conversational Analyst\"],\"LRQdKG\":[\"How is Fin Voice priced?\"],\"Lb4PAJ\":[\"Placeholder image for the Fin Flywheel animation\"],\"LfCpg0\":[\"Trusted information from your content sources\"],\"LjY8Ot\":[\"Test how Fin answers for various customer types across multiple brands by simulating different audiences or personas.\"],\"LnKZS1\":[\"Inside our AI research\"],\"LwrLQR\":[\"It is critical to understand how changes to Fin will work in production and at scale.\"],\"M6WMqv\":[\"Real-time topic insights\"],\"MJ4AzW\":[\"Senior CX Manager\"],\"MOkeR9\":[\"Thanks for trying Fin Voice\"],\"MUncmu\":[\"Startups can get \",[\"0\"],\"% off Intercom and an entire year of Fin completely free with our Early Stage Program.\"],\"MZqacE\":[\"Ask a question in natural language and get charts, tables, and clear breakdowns, not a link to a dashboard you need to interpret.\"],\"M_XB77\":[\"Get updates about upcoming events, webinars, product announcements, and helpful resources.\"],\"MdOI1I\":[\"Monitors\"],\"MeM0cU\":[\"Operator is an agent for your team that transforms how you run your support operation — from knowledge management to data insights to automation.\"],\"Mi9BUC\":[\"Learn more about \",[\"proAddOnLabel\"]],\"MjQYn5\":[\"Kyle Poyar, Editor at Growth Unhinged\"],\"MnmDGl\":[\"Webinars\"],\"Molf1w\":[\"Director of Customer Experience\"],\"MqhKEo\":[\"Mute microphone\"],\"MtSXKh\":[\"Fin improves through the [Analyze](https://fin.ai/analyze) stage of the Fin Flywheel, which continuously monitors performance across every conversation, flags areas where Fin could not resolve queries, and surfaces prioritized content improvements you can apply with one click. The more Fin runs, the more data it generates to guide those improvements, creating a compounding effect on resolution rates as you iterate.\"],\"MuvhhU\":[\"Contact Sales | Fin AI Agent\"],\"N1VJwO\":[\"Fin AI Agent Pricing | Free 14-day Trial\"],\"N4LfnX\":[\"Contact Fin Sales - Get Started with AI Agent\"],\"NEko7-\":[\"Fin is built around a flywheel where every conversation makes it smarter, automatically turning insights into recommendations and improvements. As your business evolves, Fin evolves in a cycle of continuous improvement.\"],\"NGPQJ3\":[\"Avocado Green Mattress\"],\"NKVkG0\":[\"Customer Experience Manager\"],\"NKcz5h\":[\"Fin Million Dollar Guarantee\"],\"NRMMe2\":[\"*Compared to Sonnet 4.6\"],\"NUrY9o\":[\"Categories\"],\"NdErFx\":[\"Includes all Voice 1 features\"],\"NihQNk\":[\"Customers\"],\"NjQxis\":[\"16-49\"],\"NnH3pK\":[\"Test\"],\"NqUmSe\":[\"Debug any conversation instantly\"],\"NvTlG8\":[\"Developer hub\"],\"NyAXjK\":[\", and more\"],\"NyKFP8\":[\"Pre-launch Procedure testing\"],\"NyfapX\":[\"Includes real-time insights with one-click recommendations to improve Fin’s performance, automated follow-ups, performance monitoring, and deeper integrations - your whole phone operation, easier to manage.\"],\"O-9HB1\":[\"Takes action via your APIs\"],\"O0BnSO\":[\"Instant advice, insights, and answers for agents\"],\"O3oNi5\":[\"Email\"],\"O6HYbO\":[\"Responds instantly.\"],\"O7u_1k\":[\"Fin trained on custom business rules\"],\"OKnrbq\":[\"There are endless ways Operator can transform your operations.\"],\"OMySrB\":[\"Provide global support with AI-translations\"],\"ORHr3X\":[\"Ask your data anything,\"],\"OU1W79\":[\"Featured Channels:\"],\"OZtEcz\":[\"API\"],\"O_7I0o\":[\"Select...\"],\"OaH7t3\":[\"Outcome-based pricing\"],\"OlTt6B\":[\"You're only charged for one outcome per conversation, even if Fin takes multiple actions. A billable outcome is one of the following:\\n\\n- Resolution: No further help is requested after Fin's last answer.\\n- Procedure handoff: Fin completes a Procedure you've configured to hand off to a human.\\n- Disqualification: Fin determines that a prospect doesn't match your qualification criteria and disqualifies them accordingly.\\n- Self-serve routing: Fin matches a prospect to a routing outcome marked as Self-serve, for example, directing them to sign up for a trial.\\n- Qualification: Fin matches a prospect to the qualification criteria you defined and routes them accordingly.\\n\\nResolutions, Procedure handoffs, disqualifications, and self-serve routings are $\",[\"0\"],\" each. Qualifications are $\",[\"1\"],\" each. You're not charged when a conversation is simply passed to your team without an outcome. Manage usage with configurable alerts, limits, and real-time reporting.\\n\\n[Learn how Fin outcomes work](https://www.intercom.com/help/en/articles/8205718-fin-ai-agent-outcomes).\"],\"P8e-wf\":[\"Fin voice 2\"],\"PD4Tb9\":[\"Fin matches a prospect to the qualification criteria you defined and routes them accordingly.\"],\"PHsxWo\":[\"Your content connected, in \u003c0\u003eunder an hour\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"PQ20SY\":[\"Fin auto-triaging and routing conversations\"],\"Pe1ORC\":[\"Automated performance monitors\"],\"PeO40p\":[\"Intercom helpdesk\"],\"PfaP_Z\":[\"QA across every conversation\"],\"PlGh9W\":[\"Is Fin Voice customizable to match my brand's tone and voice?\"],\"Pqs9AP\":[\"Fin is the highest performing AI Agent, consistently beating competitors in head-to-head evaluations. That’s why we offer the Fin Million Dollar Guarantee.\"],\"PxK8hG\":[\"Call disconnected\"],\"Q0MZmD\":[\"Apex Flash\"],\"Q1TBi7\":[\"Use our ROI calculator to see the impact Fin could have on your business.\"],\"Q1sIKm\":[\"See pricing plans for Fin Customer Agent, including Fin for service and Fin for sales. From $\",[\"0\"],\"/outcome.\"],\"Q7T8Yn\":[\"Configure once, apply everywhere\"],\"QFcJ2P\":[\"Fin is \u003c0\u003etrained\u003c/0\u003e to understand your business goals, all your policies, rules, guidelines, and operating procedures. This understanding enables Fin to reason about problems, and resolve very complex, multi-step workflows via \u003c1\u003eProcedures\u003c/1\u003e.\"],\"QGI_Z2\":[\"Features and capabilities\"],\"QRP2hv\":[\"Or \u003c0\u003etry taking actions\u003c/0\u003e like cancelling or changing your upcoming trip to Malibu \u003c1\u003e(booking reference: ATLAS-74961)\u003c/1\u003e.\"],\"Qd1ANN\":[\"Previews\"],\"QdHOqY\":[\"Fin is used by over \",[\"0\"],\" of the world's most forward-looking brands\"],\"Qx7DM7\":[\"Capabilities\"],\"R-cJSE\":[\"Select company size\"],\"R7SsBE\":[\"Mute\"],\"RA55Iu\":[\"Company name\"],\"RHzaC5\":[\"We improve Fin at a rapid pace. In 2025, we shipped 226 \u003c0\u003eproduct updates\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"RL6oKf\":[\"How We Built a World-Class Reranker \u003c0/\u003e\u003c1\u003eRead more\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"RLWhcp\":[\"Incident Detection\"],\"RN3QMm\":[\"Male voice. Speaks American English.\"],\"RPSjBP\":[\"You need full control of everything, so you can experiment fast and learn\"],\"RSLMpt\":[\"Powered by Apex Flash\"],\"RVSy7p\":[\"Including: \"],\"RY25xs\":[\"Custom escalation rules\"],\"R_BR4W\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTrust and safety\u003c/0\u003e are at the center of what we do. Built by a team with decades of experience in the world's most secure technology companies, Fin is architected for continuous uptime, with redundancy across regions and backed by a 99.8% SLA.\"],\"R_eJro\":[\"Using LLMs as a Reranker for RAG\u003c0/\u003e\u003c1\u003eRead more\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"R_hhfg\":[\"Free trials require no credit card to sign up. During the 14-day trial, you'll have unlimited access to Fin outcomes, with no limits on usage. There are no seat minimums or maximums, so you can get started with as many teammates as you'd like.\\n\\nTo continue using Fin after your trial ends, simply add your credit card details.\\n\\nNeed more time? Contact our sales team. We're happy to help extend your trial if needed.\"],\"Rm1gZh\":[\"Get a personalized demo\"],\"Rq4lQz\":[\"/yr\"],\"Rsfn5x\":[\"Ask Operator to review your human QA monitors, and it’ll surface what’s working, what isn’t, and why - drawing your attention where it’s needed, without hours of manual review.\"],\"S2gmK7\":[\"Watch Fin Voice in action.\"],\"S8RIEF\":[\"Includes Operator\"],\"SDTBwV\":[\"Audience testing\"],\"SGVGT3\":[\"Fin improving continuously with QA tools\"],\"SGq4_-\":[\"22 reasons to hire Fin\"],\"SHxNSo\":[\"\u003c0\u003e52% average resolution rate\u003c/0\u003e in month one\"],\"SK4sqc\":[\"View demo for Intercom\"],\"SXCynC\":[\"See how Operator changes the way you run your operation\"],\"ScH_aG\":[\"Step \",[\"0\"],\"/\",[\"1\"]],\"Se-gVj\":[\"Fin completes a Procedure designed to handoff to a human.\"],\"SlvNW1\":[\"Your brand's voice\"],\"SrDC45\":[\"Poor connection\"],\"Syj7oW\":[\"We see our customers as partners in this journey, and co-develop Fin in direct collaboration with the most forward thinking of them, to ensure we're building the best product possible.\"],\"T24p22\":[\"Per user \u003c0/\u003eper month\"],\"T3a42T\":[\"Fin for Freshdesk\"],\"T4ar7a\":[\"Complex queries\"],\"T8zAxl\":[\"Regression Tests\"],\"T91vKp\":[\"Play\"],\"TEERTx\":[\"SMS\"],\"TEO727\":[\"improvements on your behalf\"],\"TGAu2B\":[\"API support\"],\"TK5EMc\":[\"Intercom is billed in United States Dollars (USD) only. This includes Fin outcomes, additional usage charges, add-ons, and more. Right now, we can't bill in any other currencies.\"],\"TKBnE8\":[\"Free courses and certifications\"],\"TKI3KN\":[\"No further help is requested after the last AI answer.\"],\"TOnaSV\":[\"Create workflows from natural \u003c0\u003elanguage \",[\"0\"],\"\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"TTEzBy\":[\"Fin Voice is currently only available for larger businesses, but you can trial Fin.\"],\"ThZuIK\":[\"Live and on-demand sessions\"],\"TkR27F\":[\"AI Engine\"],\"TnNp6F\":[\"Get access to Fin\"],\"TrJhOs\":[\"Proactive Outbound Suite\"],\"Ts27sV\":[\"Fin has industry-leading resolution rates, averaging 76% across \",[\"0\"],\"+ customers, with many seeing over 85%. It is currently handling 2 million weekly resolutions and the average resolution rate increases 1% every month.\"],\"Ttk4Ud\":[\"Go back to Fin Voice\"],\"Tz9cnV\":[\"In the age of AI, we are all hungry to learn from each other. We organise many events, big and small, spending a lot of time in person with our customers so we can build the future together.\"],\"U27e29\":[\"Fin comes with the Blueprint for AI transformation\"],\"U32S09\":[\"Our \u003c0\u003edeployment team\u003c/0\u003e works directly with customers to optimize for their bespoke requirements, ensuring they are getting the best results possible.\"],\"UE7IQu\":[\"Fin events deliver world-class thought leadership and education\"],\"UT8wsx\":[\"You already submitted this form.\"],\"UTMxZc\":[\"VP Customer Support, Enablement \u0026 Trust\"],\"UXBCwc\":[\"Last Name\"],\"UYLz-T\":[\"Show all features\"],\"UZMLSF\":[\"Procedures let Fin handle complex queries with multiple steps, business logic, third party systems, or cross-team approvals. Combine natural language instructions with deterministic controls to create powerful Procedures that follow your exact rules when needed.\"],\"UbRg_9\":[\"Retail and ecommerce\"],\"Ucrnju\":[\"Disqualification\"],\"Uev9vZ\":[\"Data Connectors\"],\"Uf4bEl\":[\"Fin has industry leading resolution rates, averaging 76% across \",[\"0\"],\"+ customers, with many seeing over 85%.\"],\"UftkC9\":[\"Team performance summary with agent metrics\"],\"UzgRaC\":[\"Select an Industry to start interactive demo\"],\"V-D_YP\":[\"Careers\"],\"V1EGGU\":[\"First name\"],\"VCoj0g\":[\"Fin can resolve every customer issue, no matter how complex\"],\"VD6l-F\":[\"Handles tickets, cases, emails, live chat, WhatsApp, SMS, and more\"],\"VELL3e\":[\"Takes action to update external systems\"],\"VF_Uwh\":[\"Continuous improvement\"],\"VGXymC\":[\"One agent for every role\"],\"VISrrd\":[\"Builds, tests, and ships\"],\"VNYdyZ\":[\"Qualify and convert leads\"],\"VNv--i\":[\"Customizable call behavior\"],\"VONE5L\":[\"Every helpdesk\"],\"VV4z9V\":[\"Live chat\"],\"VoLC7V\":[\"Customer Agent\"],\"W28DP2\":[\"Fin is a complete AI Agent System that empowers enterprise teams to transform their business with AI — automating complex workflows, integrating seamlessly with your existing systems, and delivering high-quality support at scale without increasing headcount.\"],\"W2vUgK\":[\"Calculate savings\"],\"W7xtHi\":[\"Public Help Center and Knowledge Hub\"],\"W9SB3g\":[\"Fin for Service\"],\"WB6cW_\":[\"Year 1\"],\"WBJyUB\":[\"Configurable Inbox and Ticketing system\"],\"WGmQBA\":[\"Book an appointment\"],\"WIbszT\":[\"Control is built in with configurable alerts, limits, and real time reporting.\"],\"WRT3eL\":[\"Next video\"],\"WehWL5\":[\"Simulate escalations to teammates, workflows, or callbacks so you can be confident handoffs work seamlessly if customers need a human agent.\"],\"WigmhJ\":[\"Run fully simulated customer conversations to test Procedures from start to finish - uncovering edge cases and catching regressions before launch.\"],\"WjYsnu\":[\"Minimum commitments apply\"],\"WnCPF8\":[\"Fin for Salesforce\"],\"WoKQsj\":[\"Fin works excellently on every customer channel\"],\"Wtxezw\":[\"How does Fin handle phone and voice support?\"],\"WuAJj4\":[\"Seeing Fin solve real issues like that quickly and with care gave us real confidence.\"],\"WwM7wh\":[\"Operator | The agent for your support team\"],\"X5S-sS\":[\"Interactions with Fin Voice are subject to the \u003c0\u003eprivacy policy.\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"X5yF0-\":[\"Unmute microphone\"],\"XDFz-G\":[\"Fin is a complete AI Agent System that empowers ecommerce teams to transform their business with AI — resolving complex customer queries with on-brand answers and delivering consistent, high-quality support at scale without increasing headcount.\"],\"XHoOi-\":[\"Connection achieved\"],\"XKBqa0\":[\"Every industry-leading capability included\"],\"XQlVuB\":[\"Fin connecting to tools via API\"],\"XRWXCV\":[\"Apex Flash is different. Fine-tuned for customer service, it generates answers that are more accurate and structured for how speech sounds when delivered aloud.\"],\"XW7pDx\":[\"Extend Fin with custom actions, workflows, and integrations through a fully documented \u003c0\u003eAPI platform\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"XYLcNv\":[\"Support\"],\"X_Qcl5\":[\"Per Seat/Mo\"],\"XdYHbc\":[\"Connection timed out\"],\"XfTBBt\":[\"Full context on transfer\"],\"XhzP0P\":[\"Test handoffs before launch\"],\"XmfiOK\":[\"Prefilled from details you gave earlier as \",[\"maskedEmail\"],\".\"],\"Xrt9C_\":[\"+21 new\u003c0\u003e features\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"Xw3rVf\":[\"Test complex query \u003c0\u003ehandling \",[\"0\"],\"\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"XyhT1N\":[\"Sr AI Deployment Architect\"],\"Y0bKXi\":[\"AI Suggestions\"],\"Y1jDXy\":[\"Every Fin AI Agent feature, plus:\"],\"Y2LKXZ\":[\"See how Fin performs across real scenarios, refine responses, and confirm handoffs - so you can launch with complete confidence.\"],\"YBhZdv\":[\"Gaming\"],\"YEt67C\":[\"Preview in a sandbox\"],\"YF9TTw\":[\"Handles the entire shopping journey\"],\"YG-Ixu\":[\"Fin invented and championed outcome based pricing\"],\"YJaJhu\":[\"Unmute speaker\"],\"YQlZbJ\":[\"Avg.\"],\"Y_OtD2\":[\"Fin works with Intercom and [integrates with a range of external tools](https://fin.ai/integrations), including Salesforce, HubSpot, and Freshdesk. It follows your existing assignment rules, automations, and reporting setup, so your human team's workflow stays unchanged. When Fin escalates a conversation, it passes full context to your agents' preferred inbox.\"],\"YaM6hs\":[\"You need full stack, vertical AI, trained specifically for customer experience\"],\"YiCnOI\":[\"Apex AI models\"],\"YmofDr\":[\"Discover what Fin can do for your customer support. Get in touch with our sales team to find out more about world's number one AI Agent.\"],\"Yn-zqM\":[\"Monitor performance, spot trends, and optimize with AI-powered Suggestions, then use those Insights to retrain Fin and continuously improve your customer experience.\"],\"YqhvxC\":[\"Simple integration with your stack\"],\"Z78kuQ\":[\"Sales role\"],\"ZCFp1Z\":[\"Fin for Salesforce has been a game-changer. Fin's seamless integration meant no disruption to our existing setup, leading to faster customer responses.\"],\"ZGQMqV\":[\"Resolution rate\"],\"ZU2hBp\":[\"Fin AI Agent Demos - See Fin in Action\"],\"ZZvMVA\":[\"made possible with Fin\"],\"Zdladz\":[\"Editor, Growth Unhinged\"],\"ZeMtpp\":[\"The #1 AI agent for service\"],\"ZsrA0n\":[\"We weren't able to start the voice session. Please try again.\"],\"ZsuhdG\":[\"Operator product launch\"],\"ZzAfVc\":[\"Because every business is unique, Fin is built to put you in control.\"],\"_0oJwI\":[\"Trust\"],\"_1P4eq\":[\"Try it live now\"],\"_5psqJ\":[\"There is an Early Stage program for eligible startups. You can find more information and [apply for the Early Stage program](https://fin.ai/startups).\"],\"_Bh-7r\":[\"Performance\"],\"_BuNqt\":[\"Fin has the most compelling vision and plan for the future\"],\"_HVQzY\":[\"Transform your customer operations with Operator\"],\"_TWm-E\":[\"See Fin in action | The highest performing AI Agent\"],\"_YD0tI\":[\"Fin integrates with your entire tech stack\"],\"_ZydjU\":[\"Fin is the only Agent you can fully manage yourself, configuring tone, behavior, knowledge and more, all without needing any engineering resources.\"],\"__nm2_\":[\"Models\"],\"_ehHWt\":[\"For Fin Voice, high-volume pricing, or specialized needs, \u003c0\u003econtact sales\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"_h5tpl\":[\"50 outcomes per month minimum\"],\"_j9IKQ\":[\"Data connector and API support\"],\"_l4_RQ\":[\"We were first to introduce \u003c0\u003eoutcome based pricing\u003c/0\u003e to the market, and championed it ever since.\"],\"_zEB0r\":[\"Latency (time to first audio):\"],\"a-ytOP\":[\"Ecommerce\"],\"a0MZ3i\":[\"Fin works with Okta, Azure AD, OneLogin for SSO; supports 2FA, SCIM, and IP restrictions, with data hosted in the US, EU, or Australia based on residency needs.\"],\"a1OSGd\":[\"How does pricing on my preferred helpdesk work? (Salesforce and more)\"],\"a3LDKx\":[\"Security\"],\"a4yMT4\":[\"Per Outcome\"],\"aA7qdg\":[\"Describe the steps Fin should follow during a call. Fin turns them into a workflow you can review, test, and set live.\"],\"aF7A8-\":[\"Fin conversation quality monitoring across voice, chat, and messaging\"],\"aFhNXG\":[\"Finetuning Retrieval for Fin\u003c0/\u003e\u003c1\u003eRead more\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"aHCEmh\":[\"Pricing\"],\"aJ4pMe\":[\"FAQs\"],\"aJFnz6\":[\"Our customers include \u003c0\u003eAnthropic\u003c/0\u003e, \u003c1\u003eClay\u003c/1\u003e, \u003c2\u003eLightspeed\u003c/2\u003e, \u003c3\u003eRocket Money\u003c/3\u003e, \u003c4\u003eGamma\u003c/4\u003e and many more.\"],\"aLUxqp\":[\"Start call\"],\"aNcNUH\":[\"Clear, visual answers\"],\"abwt96\":[\"Fin is now a Customer Agent. Featuring Fin AI Agent and Intercom Helpdesk — everything you need to deliver exceptional customer support at scale.\"],\"ai9Nhd\":[\"integrations\"],\"alN5aw\":[\"Mute speaker\"],\"ano5K5\":[\"Running a customer operation usually means responding to what’s in front of you. You rarely get time to find problems, spot opportunities, and act on them.\"],\"apvdbe\":[\"Fin ROI Calculator\"],\"ar4Z1x\":[\"We believe that you should only pay for Fin when it delivers value.\"],\"asR67h\":[\"Supports: \"],\"astDB-\":[\"Blog\"],\"azHQ1a\":[\"Fin with your current helpdesk\"],\"b-KmYC\":[\"More information about resolution rate\"],\"bIlcuT\":[\"Fin runs your customer operations for you\"],\"bLxg5b\":[\"(see all plans)\"],\"bNHMzp\":[\"Business Email\"],\"bPVzPJ\":[\"CX Score is a breakthrough, AI-powered metric that gives you a complete view of your support quality across every customer conversation, no surveys required.\"],\"bVfpd4\":[\"Failed to update form\"],\"b_VtgZ\":[\"Topics Explorer\"],\"bavS8r\":[\"You're only charged for \u003c0\u003eone outcome per conversation,\u003c/0\u003e even if Fin takes multiple actions. You can control spending with usage limits and alerts.\"],\"bdqAV_\":[\"Apply Now\"],\"bdztP2\":[\"Research\"],\"bioZ3f\":[\"Jordan Thompson, AI Conversational Analyst at Raylo\"],\"blcJR4\":[\"New voices and accents\"],\"blj1v4\":[\"Fin for Ecommerce\"],\"bmQpV2\":[\"When purchasing Intercom you'll choose from three plans: Essential, Advanced, or Expert. The plan you choose determines your seat price. You'll then be charged based on the number of teammates who require Full seats. Full seats provide complete access to all features in your plan and are charged per teammate.\\n\\nLite seats are free of charge. You can [learn more about Seat types](https://www.intercom.com/help/en/articles/8205716-seats).\\n\\nAll our plans include access to:\\n\\nFin AI Agent: $\",[\"0\"],\" per outcome, meaning you only pay for the value it delivers.\\n\\nMessaging channels: Usage-based pricing for SMS, phone, product tours, and more. [Learn more about usage-based channels](https://www.intercom.com/help/en/articles/9061703-usage-based-channels).\"],\"bqvucn\":[\"What technology powers Fin?\"],\"bs1U6_\":[\"See how much Fin could save \",[\"0\"]],\"bsHBiJ\":[\"Accurate intent detection\"],\"bv55ng\":[\"Chapters\"],\"bv5Um-\":[\"Loren Kornegay, Senior CX Manager at Avocado\"],\"bwRvnp\":[\"Action\"],\"c-3jDD\":[\"Expert training and onboarding\"],\"c0qlKX\":[\"Fin Overview\"],\"cEyYbs\":[\"End call\"],\"cH0pRD\":[\"With \u003c0\u003eFin seamlessly pulling real-time order statuses\u003c/0\u003e and estimated delivery updates straight from Shopify, our customers get answers instantly without waiting for an agent.\"],\"cKIQLY\":[\"Listening\"],\"cNoUYP\":[\"Email, live chat, phone, SMS, and more\"],\"cQfiHA\":[\"Scroll to features\"],\"cTnkAe\":[\"Incident response in minutes\"],\"cW0FUb\":[\"14 day free trial. No credit card required.\"],\"cYWfjb\":[\"About Fin (formerly Intercom)\"],\"cfFkTZ\":[\"Combine Fin with Intercom for a single, fully integrated customer service platform.\"],\"cfzku2\":[\"One agent that gives you the power to understand, manage, and improve your entire customer experience in a way that’s never been possible.\"],\"cvl1r8\":[\"Fin runs on \u003c0\u003eApex 1.0\u003c/0\u003e and Apex Flash, models that are custom trained on billions of customer experience interactions.\"],\"d-T30c\":[\"The Fin Voice demo is in high demand right now. Check back again soon.\"],\"d-jYvn\":[\"POWERED BY FIN APEX 1.0\"],\"d49BtD\":[\"Transparent Pricing\"],\"d7KHUN\":[\"Emily Shirley, Business Manager, Growth Product at WHOOP\"],\"dAZMFc\":[\"Back to Fin Voice\"],\"dCak9U\":[\"Customizable tone and answer length\"],\"dCjO_U\":[\"See how Recommendations improve Fin in production.\"],\"dHid_K\":[\"Fin AI Agent works seamlessly with any helpdesk, including Salesforce, HubSpot, and more.\"],\"dKoO1j\":[\"LEADER ON G2\"],\"dVZnI3\":[\"Deploy Fin across every channel\"],\"dZRLXh\":[\"How do I test Fin before going live?\"],\"dZtMT4\":[\"Flywheel\"],\"dbdRSU\":[\"Knowledge Sources\"],\"deuwSy\":[\"Fin is architected for continuous uptime with redundancy across regions, backed by a 99.8% SLA. It holds SOC2, ISO 27001, ISO 42001, AIUC-1, ISO 27701 and HIPAA, supports Okta, Azure AD and OneLogin SSO, 2FA, SCIM and IP restrictions, with data hosted in the US, EU or Australia.\"],\"dhhUP2\":[\"View outcome pricing details\"],\"djtm0q\":[\"Every channel\"],\"dlnOxD\":[\"Multilingual\"],\"dtxpK2\":[\"Analyze\"],\"dxvEbm\":[\"Fin is trusted by more than \",[\"customerCount\"],\" leading brands\"],\"dyvxrj\":[\"\u003c0\u003e\",[\"0\"],\" average resolution rate\u003c/0\u003e, once optimized\"],\"e-SsSs\":[\"Wherever your customers are, Fin brings the same accuracy, reliability, and brand consistency to every interaction.\"],\"e1W42O\":[\"Answers and action\"],\"eBKvTq\":[\"We believe in sharing as much as we can so others can learn, publishing cutting-edge, industry-first AI research papers and heavily cited industry reports.\"],\"eEsadO\":[\"Speaking...\"],\"eF7b91\":[\"Procedures interface showing multi-step workflow configuration\"],\"eK9ZB-\":[\"Get instant access to Fin\"],\"eOPdkN\":[\"Fin hands off to your human team effortlessly, maintaining full customer context no matter which helpdesk you use.\"],\"eT1-gX\":[\"Fin Voice answer inspection with recordings, transcripts, and logic\"],\"edoA2X\":[\"[Fin Voice](https://fin.ai/voice) brings Fin to the phone, delivering instant, natural conversations that feel human and never lose context. It is simple to set up, easy to preview, and works with all major telephony systems. When a call needs a person, Fin transfers it with full context so your team picks up where Fin left off.\"],\"edri-g\":[\"Operator technical deep-dive\"],\"egkNh9\":[\"Watch demo\"],\"ejVYRQ\":[\"From\"],\"elcTu-\":[\"Fin. The highest performing Customer Agent\"],\"eoQRpb\":[\"Natural language Procedure setup\"],\"eqVUFL\":[\"200-1999\"],\"f1PeOH\":[\"Session limit reached\"],\"f1de8G\":[\"Operator builds, tests, and ships improvements to Fin on your behalf. Ask it to set up anything, from a Procedure to a Monitor, or give it a goal like increasing automation. Continuously improving Fin is now easier than ever.\"],\"fEHm5X\":[\"Get started with the\"],\"fGTkBb\":[\"Fin is trained to understand your business deeply\"],\"fRgWCo\":[\"See the impact Fin could have on your enterprise business\"],\"fX7MPK\":[\"See Fin in action\"],\"fb3spa\":[\"find problems, fix them\"],\"fgLNSM\":[\"Register\"],\"fi8BP8\":[\"\u003c0\u003e2.8% \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003ehigher resolution rate \u003c/1\u003e\"],\"foq5mO\":[\"Trust and Reliability\"],\"fouMdg\":[\"Procedure handoff\"],\"frQyxu\":[\"Get the #1 AI Agent \u003c0/\u003ewith any helpdesk\"],\"fv3pgf\":[\"Connection disrupted\"],\"g0ShrP\":[\"Fin gets better every week\"],\"g1217H\":[\"Test and deploy \u003c0\u003ewith confidence\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"g17vCG\":[\"Simulations\"],\"g2ei9k\":[\"2026 Transformation Report\"],\"g8brj0\":[\"Fin learns from every interaction and continuously improves\"],\"gCFYpM\":[\"Data connectors\"],\"gLCgz5\":[\"Thank you for your submission\"],\"gMak9k\":[\"Automatically updates your content\"],\"gQ0Z5R\":[\"Fin Voice answers calls instantly, eliminating wait times and phone menus. It resolves queries end-to-end, scales effortlessly to handle high volumes, and provides 24/7 coverage without extra staffing. Built-in previews, answer inspection, and integrations ensure seamless handoffs and accurate reporting.\"],\"gRschJ\":[\"Qualification\"],\"gU0928\":[\"Whether it's on your existing live chat tool, or the industry-leading Intercom Messenger. Fin delivers the best conversational support experience to your customers.\"],\"gVWs5O\":[\"Simple, transparent pricing that scales\"],\"gX79ly\":[\"AI Agent Engineer\"],\"gYAxO6\":[\"Test performance with AI-driven simulations.\"],\"gYj21s\":[\"Fin delivers conversational support across WhatsApp, SMS and Discord, to keep the customer experience consistent across all your channels.\"],\"gbBM4O\":[\"per outcome\"],\"gcfjr8\":[\"in action\"],\"geM9FA\":[\"Insights and reporting\"],\"gj49vQ\":[\"your telephony system\"],\"gj9ekj\":[\"Security, compliance, and privacy\"],\"gukogg\":[\"Pioneer\"],\"gvxbZg\":[\"Fin works with any helpdesk, including Salesforce, HubSpot, and more.\"],\"h-3nhz\":[\"ROI Calculator\"],\"h1mqDN\":[\"Finds the gaps before your customers do\"],\"h5Ceey\":[\"How does Fin Voice improve customer support efficiency?\"],\"h6BkYy\":[\"The world's most AI forward companies run on Fin\"],\"h8AhRw\":[\"designed for the AI Agent era\"],\"hD4PFT\":[\"Before Fin\"],\"hD4ufI\":[\"We have encoded everything into a practical step-by-step guide called the \u003c0\u003eBlueprint\u003c/0\u003e, and we run \u003c1\u003eBlueprint Events\u003c/1\u003e to teach people in person.\"],\"hDRiAO\":[\"Alongside it, a real-time layer handles speech processing - audio, pacing, and conversational flow. Separating the two is what drives the performance improvement.\"],\"hFu9g3\":[\"Perfect customer experiences made possible with Fin. Over \",[\"0\"],\" of the world's most forward looking brands use Fin across the entire customer journey.\"],\"hMjrMX\":[\"Choose from an expanded library of natural voices and accents that fit your brand. Customize greetings, phrasing, and how Fin sounds for different audiences or support tiers.\"],\"hNinLx\":[\"Operator submits every change as a proposal - think of it like a PR for your Fin configuration. You review, approve, and only then does it go to production.\"],\"hQRttt\":[\"Submit\"],\"hQX2c7\":[\"Pre-launch response testing\"],\"hSzylB\":[\"Fin Voice 2 runs on Apex Flash - our latest Fin model, built for latency-sensitive tasks. Apex Flash produces quick responses that are accurate and structured, while sounding natural when spoken aloud.\\n\\nIt’s fine-tuned for customer service, grounded in your knowledge base, and trained to apply your specific policies on every call.\"],\"hUUh5a\":[\"Fin over \u003c0\u003eVoice\u003c/0\u003e uses Apex Flash, a model designed for low latency interactions, delivering experiences that feel natural.\"],\"hXzOVo\":[\"Next\"],\"hhRkIR\":[\"Contact our sales team to learn how Fin AI Agent can transform your customer support. Schedule a personalized demo and get pricing information.\"],\"hiD0tp\":[\"Fin Voice handoff simulation to a teammate, workflow, or callback\"],\"hjFESZ\":[\"Product Updates\"],\"hvxDIc\":[\"Build on Fin's AI infrastructure\"],\"hwNLwb\":[\"Preview changes in real time to see how Fin will respond, and refine answers until you’re ready to go live.\"],\"hxsKa5\":[\"AI Group Product Manager\"],\"hyiQxG\":[\"Watch Fin Voice in action\"],\"i0qMbr\":[\"Home\"],\"i2Cdz9\":[\"Control built in\"],\"iCjwGv\":[\"Fin 3\"],\"iD9FCA\":[\"You get AI powered \u003c0\u003eInsights and QA products\u003c/0\u003e, proactively showing you dominant and emergent trends and topics in your customer experience, as well as one-click recommendations to set live and immediately improve Fin's performance.\"],\"iH35Vx\":[\"Self-serve routing\"],\"iH8pgl\":[\"Back\"],\"iJ0kpe\":[\"Add-on\"],\"iORmbc\":[\"15-49\"],\"iPhQdK\":[\"Member Services Lead at WHOOP\"],\"iTx0SR\":[\"launch\"],\"iULDoK\":[\"See how Operator detects an issue and ships a fix, start to finish.\"],\"iZOrZK\":[\"Brand term pronunciation\"],\"icpnym\":[\"Fin is built around a \u003c0\u003eflywheel\u003c/0\u003e where every conversation makes Fin smarter. As Fin does work, it learns, and automatically turns insights into recommendations and improvements.\"],\"ikwTH2\":[\"Monitor quality across voice, chat, and messaging conversations from one place. Get notified the moment a conversation falls below your standards, on any channel.\"],\"il2jCl\":[\"Deploy Fin on every channel.\"],\"ilsRhw\":[\"Close session\"],\"inESxN\":[\"Switch to Fin\"],\"io6doe\":[\"Fin is the only agent you can fully manage yourself, configuring tone, behaviour, knowledge and more without needing engineering resources. You never need to contact us to make changes, so you can experiment and learn quickly.\"],\"irD7vv\":[\"By continuing, you accept that your data will be processed in accordance with \u003c0\u003eIntercom's Privacy Policy\u003c/0\u003e.\"],\"isRobC\":[\"New\"],\"iuTRC9\":[\"Seamlessly integrate with\"],\"j0X331\":[\"Discover what Fin can do for your ecommerce business\"],\"j28q3r\":[\"Nothing ships without your approval\"],\"jEioBd\":[\"Set clear policies on tone, language, and which topics go to your human agents. Fin follows them on every call, at any scale.\"],\"jJGltn\":[\"AI Topics\"],\"jLBiZ5\":[\"AI research blog\"],\"jNVqJp\":[\"Solutions\"],\"jR7XkK\":[\"\u003c0\u003eBuilt for the\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003edemands of Voice\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"jTeTgD\":[\"Setup and operations\"],\"j_aOhC\":[\"Use Operator to find the questions Fin is getting asked that your knowledge base doesn’t answer, and have it draft the content to fill the gaps.\"],\"jaL34B\":[\"How does Intercom pricing work?\"],\"jdERs6\":[\"Conversations per month\"],\"jhTA11\":[\"Technology\"],\"jkM2_j\":[\"//initializing Fin Voice\"],\"jkzREa\":[\"Intercom\"],\"jpGrkd\":[\"Fin for Sales\"],\"jq68x3\":[\"See the impact Fin could have on your ecommerce business\"],\"jyHXkz\":[\"Any system\"],\"jyxL4H\":[\"How does the free trial work?\"],\"k0RPRP\":[\"Male voice. Speaks British English.\"],\"k5Eo4m\":[\"Set up in under an hour\"],\"kDoXai\":[\"Learn Blog\"],\"kIKb9e\":[\"Social\"],\"kODvZJ\":[\"First Name\"],\"kRJY4y\":[\"Operator knowledge\"],\"kRrYRm\":[\"Customer Agent overview\"],\"kY8Vn5\":[\"Fin is pioneering the Customer Agent: a single customer-facing agent that works across the customer journey from day 1 to year 10. It handles every role, from Service to Sales, using pre-trained skills, knowledge, customer history and context.\"],\"kc6xR7\":[\"Outcome Pricing\"],\"kcQfzF\":[\"\u003c0\u003eTry asking questions\u003c/0\u003e e.g. What's the cancellation policy? Can I bring my pet?\"],\"keFcl7\":[\"Talk to Fin about Fin\"],\"knh68V\":[\"You already submitted this form as \",[\"maskedEmail\"],\".\"],\"kwEWhc\":[\"Fin ideas\"],\"l2nHnr\":[\"Fin with Intercom\"],\"l8GUq_\":[\"20+ updates\"],\"l97XZg\":[\"As Fin does more work for you, your support costs go down, meaning you can reinvest in more strategic work to deliver superior customer experiences.\"],\"lK5wC6\":[\"Our customers are very happy, Fin is the \u003c0\u003eleader on G2\u003c/0\u003e, with a 90% satisfaction score, beating the nearest competitor by 8 percentage points.\"],\"l_oVmX\":[\"Fin is powered by Fin Apex 1.0, the [best-performing model for customer service](https://fin.ai/benchmarks). In production, Fin Apex 1.0 outperforms frontier models with higher resolution rates, fewer hallucinations, and faster responses. Rather than adapting a general-purpose model, the [Fin AI Engine](https://fin.ai/ai-engine) is architected specifically for complex support queries, retrieving, ranking, and validating answers against your content before returning a response.\"],\"laLqVv\":[\"How end users feel about AI Agents\"],\"lb_gOZ\":[\"Please try again or contact support if the problem persists.\"],\"ld77hx\":[\"We believe in sharing as much as we can, so others can learn.\"],\"ldZZy-\":[\"Deployment Services\"],\"lfFsZ4\":[\"Channels\"],\"lgEvSu\":[\"Fin Voice sandbox preview of a call scenario\"],\"liutLG\":[\"Fin can deliver conversational support experiences consistently on your social channels too, including Facebook and Instagram.\"],\"lrg6g5\":[\"Fin resolving customer questions instantly\"],\"luZjT6\":[\"Failed to submit form\"],\"lwSDSH\":[\"Senior AI Agent Engineer\"],\"lxOV3I\":[\"Bulk incident response interface showing affected conversations\"],\"lxentK\":[\"An unexpected error occurred\"],\"lyjq5X\":[\"Slack\"],\"m193Yg\":[\"Deployment\"],\"mHYdX5\":[\"Verifying an identity, processing a refund, booking an appointment: not just answers - actions. Fin connects to your systems, takes the action, and resolves the call without a transfer.\"],\"mLlO5f\":[\"Featured Capabilities:\"],\"mMmsqZ\":[\"Fin for any helpdesk\"],\"mPkInZ\":[\"Partners\"],\"mS8hnO\":[\"Demo not available\"],\"mTBVSE\":[\"What counts as a Fin outcome?\"],\"mVfxVn\":[\"Get a demo\"],\"maqjYp\":[\"Free trial\"],\"mfszZh\":[\"Fin resolves incredibly complex queries, reading and writing to complicated third-party systems with ease. It updates accounts, processes payments and refunds, troubleshoots technical issues and much more.\"],\"mmdu-9\":[\"Over 3 years\"],\"mo3O0G\":[\"Fin checks details with the customer before moving forward, so every action is accurate before it's submitted.\"],\"mqqgxM\":[\"Real-time conversation analysis\"],\"mtad7w\":[\"Choose your voice\"],\"mu7nvC\":[\"Building out Intercom's AI infra\u003c0/\u003e\u003c1\u003eRead more\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"n3fHji\":[\"Trends\"],\"nBkrKb\":[\"Startups offer: Get 93% off Intercom +\u003c0/\u003e1 year of Fin free\"],\"nDqLP1\":[\"Learn more about \",[\"copilotLabel\"]],\"nGi0au\":[\"A decorative background depicting a solar flare in space\"],\"nJv3E6\":[\"Perfect customer experiences\"],\"nM3Y_6\":[\"Customers include Anthropic, Clay, Lightspeed, Rocket Money and Gamma, spanning Software and Technology, Retail and eCommerce, Gaming, Financial Services and large Enterprise. Fin is the leader on G2 with a 90% satisfaction score, beating the nearest competitor by 8 percentage points.\"],\"nURo-U\":[\"Three years ago, Fin was launched as the first Agent for Customer Service, thereby creating the Service Agent category.\"],\"nWhpLR\":[\"Trust \u0026 security\"],\"nbfdhU\":[\"Integrations\"],\"nbtq4a\":[\"Handles background noise.\"],\"ncnCPr\":[\"Building frontier AI products\"],\"ncp9_O\":[\"Perspectives on building with AI\"],\"ndYDCP\":[\"The most natural, powerful voice agent for customer experience.\"],\"ngjg1w\":[\"Failed to load form fields\"],\"np8ozd\":[\"Brand-specific deployments\"],\"npK4zT\":[\"Consistent across every channel\"],\"nqhqMi\":[\"Fin resolves incredibly \u003c0\u003ecomplex queries\u003c/0\u003e for our thousands of customers, reading and writing to complicated 3rd party systems, and does so with ease.\"],\"nwtY4N\":[\"Something went wrong\"],\"o4-d5Y\":[\"Facebook Messenger\"],\"o72WCw\":[\"Year 3\"],\"oKQ-Ow\":[\"Automated follow-up SMS\"],\"oLU5V_\":[\"Read more about Using LLMs as a Reranker for RAG\"],\"oNjKsU\":[\"Voice selection interface showing language and voice options\"],\"oX_PYn\":[\"Three years ago Fin launched as the first agent for customer service, creating the Service Agent category. We are now pioneering perfect customer experiences across the entire customer journey, which requires a single Customer Agent, full control to experiment and learn, and full-stack vertical AI trained specifically for customer experience.\"],\"om5as3\":[\"Fin ROI Calculator | See the impact Fin can have on your business\"],\"or3xWH\":[\"We have fully transformed our own customer experience and partnered with thousands of customers to do the same, encoding everything into a practical step-by-step guide called the Blueprint, and run Blueprint Events to teach people in person.\"],\"ornMPa\":[\"Fin Voice takes action by following structured workflows and connecting to your systems. It handles complex, multi-step requests from verifying identities, and processing refunds, to changing subscriptions and booking appointments.\"],\"osYEar\":[\"Fin events deliver world class thought leadership and education\"],\"ownbFS\":[\"As your business evolves, Fin evolves, in a cycle of continuous improvement and higher performance.\"],\"oy1D_t\":[\"What channels does Fin support, and how many languages?\"],\"p-KUCi\":[\"Product Support Operations Lead at Anthropic\"],\"p26RPn\":[\"Freeze and replace card\"],\"p8y-rs\":[\"Salesforce\"],\"pA03ZR\":[\"CX AI Operations Lead at Personio\"],\"pDCc79\":[\"Availability scheduling\"],\"pKqCe6\":[\"Fin meets customers where they are, by working natively across \u003c0\u003eall channels\u003c/0\u003e, including Voice, Chat, email, Slack, social, and many more.\"],\"pNg77d\":[\"It is easy to set up, because you don't need a big migration project to use Fin. Fin is natively integrated with \u003c0\u003eIntercom\u003c/0\u003e, but also works excellently with \u003c1\u003eSalesforce\u003c/1\u003e, \u003c2\u003eHubspot\u003c/2\u003e, \u003c3\u003eFreshdesk\u003c/3\u003e, and \u003c4\u003emany other helpdesks\u003c/4\u003e.\"],\"pORaC9\":[\"Confirms key details before taking action\"],\"pSfykB\":[\"Test performance with AI-driven Simulations\"],\"pUgIIz\":[\"Improves through the Fin Flywheel: \"],\"pUhJ65\":[\"2000-4999\"],\"pZdaSb\":[\"Fin capabilities: resolve complex customer queries | Fin\"],\"paajau\":[\"Previously, improving how Fin handles a conversation often meant reviewing everything yourself – the conversation, the configuration, the content. \u003c0\u003eWith Operator, you just ask. It walks you through what happened and makes improving Fin dramatically easier.\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"pdpqVK\":[\"Deploy Fin across phone, email, chat, Slack, and more, so every customer receives accurate, personalized responses wherever they reach out.\"],\"pev__Y\":[\"Perfect customer experiences made possible with Fin\"],\"prGNwx\":[\"Fin gives you full confidence because you're in control\"],\"pxnJyA\":[\"We believe you should only pay for Fin when it delivers value. We were first to introduce outcome-based pricing to the market, with control built in via configurable alerts, limits and real-time reporting. As Fin does more work, your support costs go down.\"],\"q-mm0i\":[\"Data \u0026 Insights\"],\"q14ESw\":[\"Faster time to resolution\"],\"q4nVd6\":[\"Try it - see what you think.\"],\"qH_Ngb\":[\"Fin works for customers across many verticals including Software and Technology, Retail and eCommerce, Gaming, and in heavily regulated industries like Financial Services, and large Enterprise businesses.\"],\"qIJIrD\":[\"Testing\"],\"qJ79Wt\":[\"We didn't just want an AI answer engine. What stood out about Fin was its ability to show us where the problems are, recommend improvements, and continuously get better over time.\"],\"qORa2r\":[\"Give Operator your style guide, tone of voice, and terminology preferences - every update it proposes will match how your team writes.\"],\"qR6X1R\":[\"Select \",[\"fieldLabel\"]],\"qTmdOw\":[\"Fin didn't just perform better — it changed what our team thought automated support could be.\"],\"qWd4bB\":[\"Configure Fin's tone, behavior, and knowledge without needing engineering resources\"],\"qlRwg7\":[\"See exactly how Fin responds to callers across FAQs, complex scenarios, and sensitive topics - so you know it always meets your standards before launch.\"],\"qnkicd\":[\"Customer Service Glossary\"],\"qwjyE7\":[\"Intelligent call routing\"],\"qwvsBM\":[\"5000+\"],\"r64ohk\":[\"Error: \",[\"error\"]],\"r6Y4GL\":[\"action\"],\"rAk3MS\":[\"Workflows automations \u0026 pre-built reporting\"],\"rNgkMC\":[\"Fin Voice 1\"],\"rWtJbX\":[\"We teach them what we know, we learn from what they are doing, and very importantly, we help them connect and learn from each other.\"],\"rYG2u6\":[\"Please wait...\"],\"rerp60\":[\"Voice powered by\"],\"rjGI_Q\":[\"Privacy\"],\"rjZpLn\":[\"Learn\"],\"rpgpnl\":[\"\u003c0\u003eWhen you connect external systems to Fin to read customer information or act on it, that's when you really change how you do support.\u003c/0\u003e It stops being about answering questions. It becomes part of your operations.\"],\"rtaDaR\":[\"How Fin works\"],\"rxgUep\":[\"Complex query handling (Procedures)\"],\"rylABe\":[\"Get Fin, the #1 AI Agent, with any helpdesk. Simple, transparent pricing that scales.\"],\"s-MGs7\":[\"Resources\"],\"s2QZS6\":[\"Companies\"],\"sBcle_\":[\"Adapts to caller speech patterns\"],\"sBgKjO\":[\"Real-time Translation\"],\"sQMH0J\":[\"Most customers see about a \",[\"finResolutionRate\"],\"% \u003c0\u003e\u003c1\u003eresolution rate\u003c/1\u003e\u003c/0\u003e with Fin.\"],\"sQia9P\":[\"Log in\"],\"sQoRGc\":[\"Fin is the highest performing customer agent on the market\"],\"sTtttU\":[\"Read more about Finetuning Retrieval for Fin\"],\"sfIa2E\":[\"We’re excited to partner with all high volume customers (over 250k monthly conversions) in North America and Europe. Phase one of this program will admit customers on Intercom.\"],\"shLiny\":[\"\u003c0\u003eBuilt to resolve the most complex queries on every channel\u003c/0\u003e\"],\"sjd6-Y\":[\"Use our ROI calculator to see the impact of Fin, the complete AI Agent System that transforms customer support to deliver consistent, high-quality support at scale.\"],\"smoAZU\":[\"Fin instantly learns from a variety of public and private knowledge sources, including Help Center articles, internal support content, PDFs, and URLs.\"],\"sotj5K\":[\"Audience Testing\"],\"sq1dIh\":[[\"0\"],\"+ companies use Fin. We resolve over 2 million conversations weekly and have surpassed $400M in ARR. Founded as Intercom in 2011, reinvented for the AI era.\"],\"srRMnJ\":[\"Customize\"],\"stPLXL\":[\"Startups\"],\"swZFfT\":[\"Guidance\"],\"t0zxdk\":[\"Fin updates accounts, processes payments and refunds, troubleshoots technical issues, and much more.\"],\"t8CD3w\":[\"QA monitor performance analysis dashboard\"],\"t8lo5B\":[\"API Platform\"],\"tBVQ7t\":[\"30-language support\"],\"tBfQ4s\":[\"Run fully simulated customer conversations from start to finish to see exactly how Fin will behave before going live, so you know your Procedures work as intended.\"],\"tCl-H3\":[\"View demo\"],\"tDjOW4\":[\"Operator surfaces patterns you weren’t looking for: a spike in a topic, a drop in resolution rate, or a support issue that’s actually an engineering problem.\"],\"tQqPwq\":[\"50-199\"],\"tVXDxC\":[\"The Optimize Dashboard highlights opportunities to improve Fin’s performance with AI-powered Suggestions. Accept with one click for instant optimization.\"],\"tWALOD\":[\"Unable to start the voice session. Please try again.\"],\"tYhxKe\":[\"Phone Number (Optional)\"],\"tZeS6v\":[\"Fin works across [every channel](https://fin.ai/channels) your customers use, including phone, email, live chat, Slack, WhatsApp, and social, plus your own product through Fin's API. Fin delivers accurate, personalized responses in 45+ languages, so the experience stays consistent wherever customers reach out.\"],\"tZog_9\":[\"This empowers you to experiment and learn, quickly. Unlike competitors, you never need to contact us to make changes to any part of the system. Every aspect of configuring and customising Fin is designed to be easy to do by yourself.\"],\"taId0i\":[\"Automated feedback collection\"],\"tcFakm\":[\"Operator | An agent for your customer operations\"],\"tcj-6u\":[\"Fin has a full observability suite to understand and improve\"],\"tgPwON\":[\"Operator\"],\"tkV38A\":[\"Safety and Security\"],\"twjTkM\":[\"As Fin handles more conversations, your support costs go down, without sacrificing quality.\"],\"tyLhzp\":[\"We publish cutting edge, industry-first \u003c0\u003eAI Research papers\u003c/0\u003e, and heavily cited \u003c1\u003eindustry reports\u003c/1\u003e.\"],\"u-J4mj\":[\"Fin generates content updates to improve answers. Accept with one click, and Fin will immediately use that content to deliver better responses.\"],\"u2niAJ\":[\"Flash\"],\"u5LxBA\":[\"Fin taking action across business systems\"],\"u9B1G9\":[\"Operator credits are the unit used to measure and charge for Operator usage. They are included with Pro, and additional credits cost $\",[\"0\"],\" per credit. Simple actions use fewer credits, while more complex work, like analyzing large sets of conversations, building automation, or testing changes, uses more.\"],\"uBw1oM\":[\"Fin\"],\"uLT3Qu\":[\"Read more about Operator\"],\"uMFWaD\":[\"\u003c0\u003e-65% \u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003ereduction in hallucinations\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"uM_YrZ\":[\"The highest-performing, fastest model for customer service.\"],\"uRdK9i\":[\"AI Deployment Consultant\"],\"uSD2DQ\":[\"Our models have sophisticated checks and balances to ensure that Fin delivers accurate answers and acts as you intended.\"],\"uSMfoN\":[\"Verify\"],\"uXXyBx\":[\"Not you? Start over\"],\"uXsx1a\":[\"Fin. The #1 AI Agent for Customer Service, Sales, and Ecommerce\"],\"ucXHom\":[\"Operator: the product launch\"],\"ue5tfz\":[\"\u003c0\u003eFin handles even the most complex queries through a continuous improvement loop called the Fin Flywheel.\u003c/0\u003e Train Fin on your Procedures, knowledge, and policies, test performance before launch, deploy across every channel, then analyze and improve with AI-powered Insights, so every query is resolved accurately and consistently.\"],\"uen72V\":[\"Read more about How We Built a World-Class Reranker\"],\"upf0Nr\":[\"Voice 2\"],\"uvTfRb\":[\"Guidance ensures every response reflects your brand voice and policies. Define tone, vocabulary, and style, and set rules for specific brands, customer segments, or product lines.\"],\"uyJsf6\":[\"About\"],\"uzxuoP\":[\"How quickly can we get Fin set up?\"],\"v8ft9u\":[\"\u003c0\u003eKeep your knowledge base current,\u003c/0\u003e \u003c1\u003ewithout writing a single article\u003c/1\u003e\"],\"vAxfd-\":[\"Fin is the Customer Agent company delivering perfect customer experiences\"],\"vBpc8N\":[\"Here's just a sample of what it can do for you.\"],\"vFq5kI\":[\"Kurt Dwiggins, Customer Experience Manager at Avocado\"],\"vZscRu\":[\"The only helpdesk\"],\"vaVv8o\":[\"AI Research\"],\"vaZM6N\":[\"Watch Fin Voice \"],\"vge65g\":[\"Ideas Blog\"],\"vo4vdy\":[\"Fin is a complete AI Agent System that empowers financial services teams to transform their business with AI — delivering accurate, compliant resolutions for complex financial queries, and high-quality support at scale without increasing headcount.\"],\"vt1D15\":[\"Fin Voice works with your existing telephony setup. You can get started quickly with simple call-forwarding, or choose a deeper SIP integration if you need more control and analytics. Either way, you can adopt Fin Voice without downtime or disruption.\"],\"vtK1kC\":[\"Now, Operator does this work for you – uncovering why a metric has dropped and fixing it, continuously tuning Fin to deliver better results, and keeping your knowledge base current without you writing a single thing.\"],\"vx9oGI\":[\"Weekly releases\"],\"wO_lg2\":[\"Fin gets better in production\"],\"wOj1cy\":[\"Business email address\"],\"wQRBfv\":[\"The world's best helpdesk, designed for the AI Agent era\"],\"w_33IE\":[\"HubSpot\"],\"wbyegM\":[\"See the impact Fin could have on your financial services business\"],\"wfhygt\":[\"Combine Fin and Intercom, the complete solution for AI and human agents.\"],\"wn6K22\":[\"I’ve been using Operator daily and ran experiments to compare its output with my own analysis – \u003c0\u003eit’s very accurate. It’s just as strong at high-level trend analysis as it is at debugging individual conversations.\u003c/0\u003e That’s a real limitation when using an LLM connector on its own– you get conversational depth but nothing on reporting or trends.\"],\"wrPZng\":[\"Ready to try Fin with your own content?\"],\"wuL5nL\":[\"Call quality\"],\"x7Y9aS\":[\"per \u003c0/\u003eoutcome\"],\"x9jl_U\":[\"Fin working across every channel\"],\"xADE1m\":[\"Watch Demo\"],\"xAGNMB\":[\"Go back to the homepage\"],\"xDr_ct\":[\"End\"],\"xECY01\":[\"Procedures\"],\"xGVfLh\":[\"Continue\"],\"xNH8DX\":[\"Calculate potential savings\"],\"xOw5tk\":[\"Background noise reduction\"],\"xTk4mZ\":[\"Increase agent efficiency with a personal AI assistant in the inbox.\"],\"xUjmSx\":[\"Vice President, Customer Support\"],\"xfb6rl\":[\"Train Fin on your knowledge and policies.\"],\"xoLQqX\":[\"Fin Voice telephony integration diagram\"],\"xpN59a\":[\"Outbound\"],\"xtiZmX\":[\"Apex\"],\"xwxQ1w\":[\"\u003c0\u003eOperator\u003c/0\u003e is an agent that runs your customer operations\"],\"y-wUr9\":[\"Operator data\"],\"y0Trtq\":[\"Fin resolves complex customer support queries across every channel, with a 67% average resolution rate and many customers seeing 85%+.\"],\"y4pRZ2\":[\"Give your business an AI teammate, free for 14 days\"],\"yX_fW_\":[\"Fin cost\"],\"yZlGkV\":[\"AI Recommendations\"],\"ydjCOJ\":[\"The Fin Blueprint — a practical guide to transforming customer support with AI\"],\"yhMzXw\":[\"Fin delivers best-in-market results by partnering deeply with customers\"],\"yliD7C\":[\"Operator automation\"],\"ywG5Vy\":[\"Proactive insights\"],\"yz7wBu\":[\"Close\"],\"z044rq\":[\"Your savings\"],\"z0Bm3F\":[\"Optimize Dashboard\"],\"z12kLq\":[\"Watch a full product demo while you wait.\"],\"z3ZVln\":[\"If you're debating whether to build your own AI solution or buy one, as a fast-growing company in a complex space, my advice would be to buy – and specifically, buy Fin.\"],\"z4_e4D\":[\"Your connection is too unstable to continue. The session will end soon.\"],\"z7bBd4\":[\"Handle complex queries\"],\"z8QBWH\":[\"Operator spots problems, finds opportunities to improve, and acts on them, for example tuning Fin, keeping your knowledge current, and scaling automation as your business changes.\"],\"zCuPJ9\":[\"Ecommerce role\"],\"zEhxzq\":[\"Fin for Customer Service\"],\"zG50sq\":[\"So Fin has a full \u003c0\u003etesting\u003c/0\u003e suite to run simulations, regression testing, and manual inspection. This gives you the confidence to set changes live, knowing they will improve the customer experience.\"],\"zGbOVS\":[\"Company Name\"],\"zLk8z7\":[\"Knows when to listen and when to speak.\"],\"zM5iJ5\":[\"Use Fin’s API to embed Fin into your custom app, delivering fast, accurate support wherever your customers need it, without changing your existing systems.\"],\"zauz8e\":[\"Get started with Fin Voice.\"],\"znLmwx\":[\"Fin for Success\"],\"zna3ie\":[\"Meet Fin Voice 2. The most natural, powerful voice agent, for customer experience.\"],\"zqWqP0\":[\"Simulation Tests\"],\"zuoIYL\":[\"Speaker\"],\"zwWKhA\":[\"Learn more\"]},\"sourceLocale\":\"en-US\",\"pseudoLocale\":\"x-pseudo\",\"children\":[\"$L3e\",\"$L3f\"]}]}]}]}]}]}],\"$L40\",\"$L41\",\"$L42\",\"$L43\",\"$L44\",\"$L45\",\"$L46\",\"$L47\",\"$L48\",\"$L49\",\"$L4a\",\"$L4b\",false]}]]}]}]\n4c:T31d2,[{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai\",\"url\":\"https://fin.ai\",\"name\":\"Fin. The #1 AI Agent for Customer Service, Sales, and Ecommerce\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai/#website\"},\"about\":{\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai/#organization\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://fin.ai/img/social/home-v2.jpg\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-06-12T09:00:00-07:00\",\"description\":\"Fin is now a Customer Agent. Featuring Fin AI Agent and Intercom Helpdesk — everything you need to deliver exceptional customer support at scale.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"mainEntity\":{\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai#reasons-to-hire-fin\"},\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"ReadAction\",\"target\":[\"https://fin.ai\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"ItemList\",\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai#reasons-to-hire-fin\",\"name\":\"22 reasons to hire Fin\",\"description\":\"The 22 reasons businesses choose Fin as their AI Customer Agent, spanning performance, proprietary AI models, channels, helpdesk integrations, trust and security, customization, pricing and vision.\",\"numberOfItems\":22,\"itemListOrder\":\"https://schema.org/ItemListOrderAscending\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Fin is the highest performing customer agent on the market\",\"description\":\"Fin has industry-leading resolution rates, averaging 76% across 12,000+ customers, with many seeing over 85%. It is currently handling 2 million weekly resolutions and the average resolution rate increases 1% every month.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Fin is used by over 12,000 of the world's most forward-looking brands\",\"description\":\"Customers include Anthropic, Clay, Lightspeed, Rocket Money and Gamma, spanning Software and Technology, Retail and eCommerce, Gaming, Financial Services and large Enterprise. Fin is the leader on G2 with a 90% satisfaction score, beating the nearest competitor by 8 percentage points.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Fin performs best because it runs on our proprietary AI models\",\"description\":\"Fin runs on Apex 1.0 and Apex Flash, models custom-trained on billions of customer experience interactions. They are the highest performing, fastest and cheapest models for customer experience, with sophisticated checks and balances to ensure accurate answers.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Fin works across the entire customer journey\",\"description\":\"Fin is pioneering the Customer Agent: a single customer-facing agent that works across the customer journey from day 1 to year 10. It handles every role, from Service to Sales, using pre-trained skills, knowledge, customer history and context.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Fin gets better every week\",\"description\":\"Fin improves at a rapid pace. In 2025 we shipped 226 product updates, and as of June 2026 we have already shipped 191 this year, on track to 3x our productivity thanks to deep investment in AI engineering.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Fin can resolve every customer issue, no matter how complex\",\"description\":\"Fin resolves incredibly complex queries, reading and writing to complicated third-party systems with ease. It updates accounts, processes payments and refunds, troubleshoots technical issues and much more.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":7,\"name\":\"Fin integrates with your entire tech stack\",\"description\":\"Fin connects to all your systems, pulling in customer data, personalising responses and taking actions via API, Data Connectors or MCP. Extend Fin with custom actions, workflows and integrations through a fully documented API platform.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":8,\"name\":\"Fin works excellently on every customer channel\",\"description\":\"Fin meets customers where they are, working natively across all channels including Voice, Chat, email, Slack and social. Fin over Voice uses Apex Flash, a model designed for low-latency interactions that feel natural.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":9,\"name\":\"Fin works seamlessly with every helpdesk\",\"description\":\"Fin hands off to your human team effortlessly, maintaining full customer context. It is natively integrated with Intercom and works with Salesforce, Hubspot, Freshdesk and many other helpdesks, and can be live in less than an hour.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":10,\"name\":\"Fin gives you full confidence because you're in control\",\"description\":\"Fin is the only agent you can fully manage yourself, configuring tone, behaviour, knowledge and more without needing engineering resources. You never need to contact us to make changes, so you can experiment and learn quickly.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":11,\"name\":\"Fin is built with trust, safety and reliability at the core\",\"description\":\"Fin is architected for continuous uptime with redundancy across regions, backed by a 99.8% SLA. It holds SOC2, ISO 27001, ISO 42001, AIUC-1, ISO 27701 and HIPAA, supports Okta, Azure AD and OneLogin SSO, 2FA, SCIM and IP restrictions, with data hosted in the US, EU or Australia.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":12,\"name\":\"Fin learns from every interaction and continuously improves\",\"description\":\"Fin is built around a flywheel where every conversation makes it smarter, automatically turning insights into recommendations and improvements. As your business evolves, Fin evolves in a cycle of continuous improvement.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":13,\"name\":\"Fin is trained to understand your business deeply\",\"description\":\"Fin is trained to understand your business goals, policies, rules, guidelines and operating procedures, enabling it to resolve complex multi-step workflows via Procedures. It communicates in your brand voice, speaks dozens of languages and works 24 hours a day.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":14,\"name\":\"Fin has a full testing suite to give you confidence before setting changes live\",\"description\":\"Fin has a full testing suite to run simulations, regression testing and manual inspection, so you can understand how changes will work in production and at scale before setting them live.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":15,\"name\":\"Fin has a full observability suite to understand and improve\",\"description\":\"Fin lets you measure and monitor everything in your customer experience and operations, with alerts on what matters most. AI-powered Insights and QA products surface dominant and emergent trends, plus one-click recommendations to improve performance.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":16,\"name\":\"Fin runs your customer operations for you\",\"description\":\"Fin Operator is an agent that runs your customer operations, orchestrating and automating the work behind the scenes. It spots problems, finds opportunities to improve and acts on them, tuning Fin, keeping knowledge current and scaling automation as your business changes.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":17,\"name\":\"Fin comes with the Blueprint for AI transformation\",\"description\":\"We have fully transformed our own customer experience and partnered with thousands of customers to do the same, encoding everything into a practical step-by-step guide called the Blueprint, and run Blueprint Events to teach people in person.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":18,\"name\":\"Fin delivers best-in-market results by partnering deeply with customers\",\"description\":\"Our deployment team works directly with customers to optimise for their bespoke requirements. We see customers as partners and co-develop Fin in direct collaboration with the most forward-thinking of them.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":19,\"name\":\"Fin's groundbreaking AI research is public by default\",\"description\":\"We believe in sharing as much as we can so others can learn, publishing cutting-edge, industry-first AI research papers and heavily cited industry reports.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":20,\"name\":\"Fin events deliver world-class thought leadership and education\",\"description\":\"We organise many events, big and small, spending time in person with customers to build the future together. We teach what we know, learn from what they are doing, and help them connect and learn from each other.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":21,\"name\":\"Fin invented and championed outcome-based pricing\",\"description\":\"We believe you should only pay for Fin when it delivers value. We were first to introduce outcome-based pricing to the market, with control built in via configurable alerts, limits and real-time reporting. As Fin does more work, your support costs go down.\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":22,\"name\":\"Fin has the most compelling vision and plan for the future\",\"description\":\"Three years ago Fin launched as the first agent for customer service, creating the Service Agent category. We are now pioneering perfect customer experiences across the entire customer journey, which requires a single Customer Agent, full control to experiment and learn, and full-stack vertical AI trained specifically for customer experience.\"}]},{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai/#primaryimage\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"url\":\"https://fin.ai/img/social/home-v2.jpg\",\"contentUrl\":\"https://fin.ai/img/social/home-v2.jpg\",\"caption\":\"The #1 AI Agent for all your customer service\"},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai/#website\",\"url\":\"https://fin.ai/\",\"name\":\"Fin\",\"description\":\"One AI Customer Agent for Sales, Service, Support and Ecommerce. Featuring Fin AI Agent and Intercom Helpdesk.\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"copyrightHolder\":{\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai/#organization\"}},{\"@type\":[\"Organization\",\"Brand\"],\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai/#organization\",\"name\":\"Fin\",\"alternateName\":[\"Fin AI\",\"Intercom\"],\"url\":\"https://fin.ai/\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai/#logo\",\"url\":\"https://fin.ai/favicons/favicon-black.png\",\"contentUrl\":\"https://fin.ai/favicons/favicon-black.png\",\"caption\":\"Fin Logo\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai/#logo\"},\"description\":\"Fin is the Customer Agent company delivering perfect customer experiences – from support to sales to commerce.\",\"foundingDate\":\"2011\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/fin/\",\"https://x.com/fin_ai\",\"https://www.instagram.com/fin_customer_agent/\",\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCJG0MvLP03kyzzAkD-w98aQ\"],\"contactPoint\":[{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"sales\",\"url\":\"https://fin.ai/contact-sales\"}],\"subjectOf\":[{\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai/#app\"},{\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai/#video-anthropic\"}]},{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai/#app\",\"name\":\"Fin AI Agent\",\"url\":\"https://fin.ai/\",\"applicationCategory\":\"CustomerSupportApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Web\",\"inLanguage\":[\"en\"],\"description\":\"Fin uses industry-leading capabilities to deliver accurate answers and resolve complex customer support queries across any channel—including email, live-chat, phone, and social.\",\"featureList\":[\"Industry-leading resolution rates, averaging 76% across 12,000+ customers\",\"Runs on proprietary Apex 1.0 and Apex Flash AI models built for customer experience\",\"Works across the entire customer journey, from Service to Sales to Ecommerce\",\"Works natively across every channel including Voice, Chat, email, Slack and social\",\"Integrates with every helpdesk, including Intercom, Salesforce, Hubspot and Freshdesk\",\"Connects to your tech stack via API, Data Connectors and MCP\",\"Resolves complex multi-step workflows via Procedures\",\"Fully self-serve configuration of tone, behaviour and knowledge\",\"Enterprise-grade trust and security: SOC2, ISO 27001, ISO 42001, AIUC-1, ISO 27701 and HIPAA\",\"Testing suite with simulations and regression testing\",\"Observability suite with AI-powered Insights and QA\",\"Fin Operator to orchestrate and automate customer operations\",\"Outcome-based pricing — only pay when Fin delivers value\"],\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai/#organization\"},\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai/#website\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"url\":\"https://fin.ai/pricing\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\",\"priceSpecification\":{\"@type\":\"UnitPriceSpecification\",\"price\":0.99,\"unitText\":\"Per Outcome\"},\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\"}},{\"@type\":\"VideoObject\",\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai/#video-anthropic\",\"name\":\"Build vs. buy: Why Anthropic chose Fin\",\"description\":\"If you're debating whether to build your own AI solution or buy one, my advice would be to buy – and specifically, buy Fin.\",\"embedUrl\":\"https://fast.wistia.com/embed/iframe/2px6q5pt0a\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://fin.ai/img/home/anthropic-thumbnail.webp\",\"uploadDate\":\"2024-04-10T02:13:00-07:00\",\"duration\":\"PT2M18S\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai/#organization\"},\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://fin.ai\"},\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"WatchAction\",\"target\":\"https://fast.wistia.com/embed/iframe/2px6q5pt0a\"}}]}]23:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"id\":\"home-schema\",\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$4c\"}}],\"$L4d\",\